pe_a_pada" href="अचल">acala</a>. (M.B. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="शल्य">śalya</a> Parva, Chapter 85, Verse 74).</div></div></div>

अचल_३|अचल|అచల_౩|అచల|ಅಚಲ_೩|ಅಚಲ|acala_3|acala|achala_3|achala|_pe_@17|_pe_pn2R
