are a few other devalokas on the same <a class="pe_a_pada" href="मोउन्तैन्">mountain</a>. They are: Indraloka, Yamaloka, Śivaloka or <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कैलास">kailāsa</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सत्यलोक">satyaloka</a> and <a class="pe_a_pada" href="वैकुण्ठ">vaikuṇṭha</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="देवी">devī</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भागवत">bhāgavata</a>).</div></div></div>

