 href="सोमदत्त">somadatta</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="कथासरित्सागर">kathāsaritsāgara</a>-Kathāpīṭhalambaka-Taraṅga 1. See also the word GUṆAVARA).</div></div></div>

