f="देअथ्">death</a>--<a class="pe_a_pada" href="काल">kāla</a>) keeps in which all the virtuous and sinful actions of men are recorded.</div></div></div>

अग्रयणी|అగ్రయణీ|ಅಗ್ರಯಣೀ|agrayaṇī|agrayaNii|agrayaNee|_pe_@87|_pe_pn17L
