 class="pe_a_pada" href="अनुशासन पर्व">anuśāsana parva</a>, it is said that he never ate non-vegetarian food in his life. </div></div></div>

ऐन्दव|ఐన్దవ|ಐನ್ದವ|aindava|_pe_@107|_pe_pn18R
