ountain</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="शृंगवान्">śṛṅgavān</a>. (See Śloka 37, Chapter 6, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भीष्म पर्व">bhīṣma parva</a>).</div></div></div>

