avas</a>. (M.B., <a class="pe_a_pada" href="द्रोण">droṇa</a> Parva, Chapter 95, Stanza 46 and Chapter 176, Stanza 6).<span class="NIvirupu"><br><br></span><a class="pe_a_pada" href="अलायुध">alāyudha</a> combated with Bhīmasena and <a class="pe_a_pada" href="घटोत्कच">ghaṭotkaca</a> and was killed by <a class="pe_a_pada" href="घटोत्कच">ghaṭotkaca</a>.</div></div></div>

