रत">bhārata</a> was his work. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अमरचन्द्र">amaracandra</a> was a Jaina priest. It is said that he was a courtier of Vīsaladeva, the son of King Vīradhavala who ruled over Gujarat from 1243 to 1262.</div></div></div>

