This <a class="pe_a_pada" href="असुर">asura</a> had been doing much harm to the hermits. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुरुकुत्स">purukutsa</a> was the hermit whom he tormented most. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="इन्द्र">indra</a> vanquished this <a class="pe_a_pada" href="असुर">asura</a> and destroyed seven of his cities. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="ऋग्वेद">ṛgveda</a>, Maṇḍala 1, Anuvāka 11, Sūkta 63, Khaṇḍa 7).</div></div></div>

