undarī</a>. She was married to <a class="pe_a_pada" href="विश्वावसु">viśvāvasu</a>. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कुम्भीनसी">kumbhīnasī</a> was her daughter. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="वाल्मीकि">vālmīki</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="रामायण">rāmāyaṇa</a>, Uttarakāṇḍa).</div></div></div>

