ar. (M.B., <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भीष्म पर्व">bhīṣma parva</a>, Chapter 25, Verse 15). </div></div></div>

अनपायचोल|అనపాయచోల|ಅನಪಾಯಚೋಲ|anapāyacola|anapaayachola|_pe_@264|_pe_pn35R
