" href="ब्रह्मा">brahmā</a> is seen to have been called by the name <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अंगारक">aṅgāraka</a> also. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="महाभारत">mahābhārata</a>, Sabhā Parva, Chapter 11, Stanza 29).</div></div></div>

