a</a>. (M.B., Sabhā Parva, Chapter 10, Verse 18). He was a king of the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अंग">aṅga</a> dynasty. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="अग्नि">agni</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुराण">purāṇa</a>, Chapter 277).</div></div></div>

