a_pada" href="श्वासा">śvāsā</a>. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अनिल">anila</a> married <a class="pe_a_pada" href="शिवा">śivā</a> and had two sons, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="मनोजव">manojava</a> and Avijñāti. (M.B., Ādi Parva, Chapter 66, Verses 17-25).</div></div></div>

