cajanya</a> created the elements named Anudāttas. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पाञ्चजन्य">pāñcajanya</a> generated these elements from his two hands with the help of his spiritual strength (tapaśśakti). (M.B., Vana Parva, Chapter 220, Verse 10).</div></div></div>

