" href="हर">hara</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="बहुरूप">bahurūpa</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="त्र्यम्बक">tryambaka</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="वृषाकपि">vṛṣākapi</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="शम्भु">śambhu</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कपर्दी">kapardī</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="रैवत">raivata</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="मृगव्याध">mṛgavyādha</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सर्प">sarpa</a> and Kapāli. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="अग्नि">agni</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुराण">purāṇa</a>, Chapter 18).</div></div></div>

