al maids and such others also are worshipped. Among these there are Vasus, Nāgas, Asuras, Paiśācas, Vetālas and many other classes. These are the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सेमि-गोद्स्">semi-gods</a>. (See Page 27 of Nāmvanaṅgum Daivaṅgal).</div></div></div>

