Parva, Chapter 208, Verse 8 refers to one <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अरिष्टनेमि">ariṣṭanemi</a>, the second son of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कश्यप">kaśyapa</a>.</div></div></div>

अरिष्टनेमि_३|अरिष्टनेमि|అరిష్టనేమి_౩|అరిష్టనేమి|ಅರಿಷ್ಟನೇಮಿ_೩|ಅರಿಷ್ಟನೇಮಿ|ariṣṭanemi_3|ariṣṭanemi|ariShTanemi_3|ariShTanemi|_pe_@434|_pe_pn48L
