da" href="पाण्डवस्">pāṇḍavas</a> lived incognito in the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="विराट">virāṭa</a> kingdom. (M.B., <a class="pe_a_pada" href="विराट">virāṭa</a> Parva, Chapter 10, Verse 5).</div></div></div>

