the Sāmudraka <a class="pe_a_pada" href="तीर्थ">tīrtha</a> nearby and also starves one will get the results of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अश्वमेध">aśvamedha</a> yāga. (M.B., Vana Parva, Chapter 84, Verse 41).</div></div></div>

