nd in the play ‘Kālakeyavadha’ the character of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अर्जुन">arjuna</a> do enact this. Increasing step by step the gesture takes eight forms in combination before it is finished accompanied by background drumming and music. (Kathakali).</div></div></div>

