, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="लोभ">lobha</a> (greed), <a class="pe_a_pada" href="मोह">moha</a> (delusion), <a class="pe_a_pada" href="मद">mada</a> (arrogance), Mātsarya (rivalry), Dambha (pride) and Asūyā (jealousy).</div></div></div>

