_cnpaTTika">Gold.</td></tr><tr class="pe_cnpaTTika"><td class="pe_cnpaTTika">2. Rajatam </td><td class="pe_cnpaTTika">Silver. </td></tr><tr class="pe_cnpaTTika"><td class="pe_cnpaTTika">3. Tāmram </td><td class="pe_cnpaTTika">Copper.</td></tr><tr class="pe_cnpaTTika"><td class="pe_cnpaTTika">4. Sīsakam </td><td class="pe_cnpaTTika">Lead.</td></tr><tr class="pe_cnpaTTika"><td class="pe_cnpaTTika">5. Kāntikam </td><td class="pe_cnpaTTika">Mercury.</td></tr><tr class="pe_cnpaTTika"><td class="pe_cnpaTTika">6. Vaṁśam </td><td class="pe_cnpaTTika">Vañgam--Tiu.</td></tr><tr class="pe_cnpaTTika"><td class="pe_cnpaTTika">7. Lauham </td><td class="pe_cnpaTTika">Iron.</td></tr><tr class="pe_cnpaTTika"><td class="pe_cnpaTTika">8. Tikṣṇalauham </td><td class="pe_cnpaTTika">Steel.</div></div></div>

