र्भी">vaidarbhī</a>. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कुशाम्ब">kuśāmba</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कुशनाभ">kuśanābha</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="असूर्तरजस">asūrtarajasa</a> and <a class="pe_a_pada" href="वसु">vasu</a> are the four sons of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कुश">kuśa</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="सर्ग">sarga</a> 32, Bālakāṇḍa, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="वाल्मीकि">vālmīki</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="रामायण">rāmāyaṇa</a>).</div></div></div>

