ss="pe_a_pada" href="कश्यप">kaśyapa</a>, grandson of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="ब्रह्मा">brahmā</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="अग्नि">agni</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुराण">purāṇa</a>, Chapter 19).</div></div></div>

