uddhacarita and Saundarananda  and a drama called Śāriputraprakaraṇa. He lived in the 2nd Century A.D. His history of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="बुद्ध">buddha</a> (Buddhacarita) was translated into Chinese during the period 414 to 421 A.D. He was known under the following names also: Ācārya, Bhadanta, Mahāvādī and Bhikṣu.</div></div></div>

