>skanda</a> on the battlefield. They were <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अतिशृंग">atiśṛṅga</a> and <a class="pe_a_pada" href="उच्छृंग">ucchṛṅga</a>. (M.B., <a class="pe_a_pada" href="शल्य">śalya</a> Parva, Chapter 45, Verses 49, 50).</div></div></div>

अतिस्थिर|అతిస్థిర|ಅತಿಸ್ಥಿರ|atisthira|_pe_@617|_pe_pn74L
