ābhārata</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="द्रोण पर्व">droṇa parva</a>, Chapter 11, Stanza 27).</div></div></div>

अवैशाख|అవైశాఖ|ಅವೈಶಾಖ|avaiśākha|avaishaakha|_pe_@645|_pe_pn78L
