 was annexed by <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सहदेव">sahadeva</a> by defeating its ruler in a game of dice.</div></div></div>

आंगरिष्ठ|आङ्गरिष्ठ|ఆంగరిష్ఠ|ఆఙ్గరిష్ఠ|ಆಂಗರಿಷ್ಠ|ಆಙ್ಗರಿಷ್ಠ|āṅgariṣṭha|aaMgariShTha|aangariShTha|_pe_@735|_pe_pn89R
