ref="अर्जुन">arjuna</a> along with <a class="pe_a_pada" href="शकुनि">śakuni</a>. (Śloka 122, Chapter 156, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="द्रोण पर्व">droṇa parva</a>, M.B.).</div></div></div>

आरुणि_५|आरुणि|ఆరుణి_౫|ఆరుణి|ಆರುಣಿ_೫|ಆರುಣಿ|āruṇi_5|āruṇi|aaruNi_5|aaruNi|_pe_@765|_pe_pn91L
