>, Chapter 17, Verse 121).</div></div></div>

आषाढभूति|ఆషాఢభూతి|ಆಷಾಢಭೂತಿ|āṣāḍhabhūti|aaShaaDhabhuuti|aaShaaDhabhooti|_pe_@775|_pe_pn92R
