href="अनुशासन पर्व">anuśāsana parva</a>, Chapter 106, Verse 26).</div></div></div>

आषाढ|ఆషాఢ|ಆಷಾಢ|āṣāḍha|aaShaaDha|_pe_@777|_pe_pn92R
