">kathāsaritsāgara</a>, Kathāmukhalambaka, 5th Taraṅga, we find a reference to an elephant called Bhadravatī and a mahout named <a class="pe_a_pada" href="आषाढक">āṣāḍhaka</a> in the palace of the heroine, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="वासवदत्ता">vāsavadattā</a>.</div></div></div>

