ss="pe_a_pada" href="चातुर्वर्ण्यम्">cāturvarṇyam</a>. (Chapter 151, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अग्नि">agni</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुराण">purāṇa</a>).</div></div></div>

