>śrī kṛṣṇa</a> he attained Rājyalakṣmī. (Chapter 28, Udyoga Parva, M.B.).</div></div></div>

बभ्रु_४|बभ्रु|బభ్రు_౪|బభ్రు|ಬಭ್ರು_೪|ಬಭ್ರು|babhru_4|babhru|_pe_@827|_pe_pn96R
