rificial fire of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="जनमेजय">janamejaya</a> and was burnt to <a class="pe_a_pada" href="देअथ्">death</a>. (M.B., Ādi Parva, Chapter 57, Stanza 13).</div></div></div>

