ada" href="श्री कृष्ण">śrī kṛṣṇa</a> visited his palace. At that time he received much good advice from <a class="pe_a_pada" href="श्री कृष्ण">śrī kṛṣṇa</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="भागवत">bhāgavata</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="स्कन्ध">skandha</a> 10).</div></div></div>

