ss="pe_a_pada" href="महाभारत">mahābhārata</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भीष्म पर्व">bhīṣma parva</a>, Chapter 28 that he was killed by Bhīmasena in the battle of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="महाभारत">mahābhārata</a>.</div></div></div>

