="प्रजापति">prajāpati</a>. Mention is made about this serpent in <a class="pe_a_pada" href="महाभारत">mahābhārata</a>, Udyoga Parva, Chapter 103.</div></div></div>

बाह्याश्वन्|బాహ్యాశ్వన్|ಬಾಹ್ಯಾಶ್ವನ್|bāhyāśvan|baahyaashvan|_pe_@871|_pe_pn98R
