>ikṣvāku</a> dynasty of the daughter of Maṇḍūkarāja. This <a class="pe_a_pada" href="बल">bala</a> had two wives, Śalā and Dalā. (Śloka 38, Chapter 192, Vana Parva, M.B.).</div></div></div>

