pada" href="सुब्रह्मण्य">subrahmaṇya</a>. The name of the other was <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अतिबल">atibala</a>. (Śloka 44, Chapter 91, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="शल्य">śalya</a> Parva, M.B.).</div></div></div>

