pada" href="सिन्धु">sindhu</a>. He helped <a class="pe_a_pada" href="जयद्रथ">jayadratha</a> in kidnapping <a class="pe_a_pada" href="द्रौपदी">draupadī</a>. (M.B., Vana Parva, Chapter 265, Stanza 12).</div></div></div>

