">drupada</a>. Mention is made in <a class="pe_a_pada" href="महाभारत">mahābhārata</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="द्रोण">droṇa</a> Parva, Chapter 156, that <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अश्वत्थामा">aśvatthāmā</a> killed him in the battle of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कुरुक्षेत्र">kurukṣetra</a>.</div></div></div>

