tsya</a>, the King of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="विराट">virāṭa</a>. During the battle of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कुरुक्षेत्र">kurukṣetra</a> he had taken the side of the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पाण्डवस्">pāṇḍavas</a> and had fought against the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कौरवस्">kauravas</a>. (M.B., <a class="pe_a_pada" href="द्रोण पर्व">droṇa parva</a>, Chapter 158).</div></div></div>

