d father of King <a class="pe_a_pada" href="बृहदश्व">bṛhadaśva</a>. (Navama <a class="pe_a_pada" href="स्कन्ध">skandha</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भागवत">bhāgavata</a>). </div></div></div>

