">bhaṅga</a> was burnt to ashes at the Serpent <a class="pe_a_pada" href="यज्ञ">yajña</a> performed by King <a class="pe_a_pada" href="जनमेजय">janamejaya</a>. (M.B., Chapter 57, Verse 9).</div></div></div>

