 <a class="pe_a_pada" href="गुरु">guru</a> of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सूर्य">sūrya</a>. (Śloka 42, Chapter 1, Ādi Parva, M.B.).</div></div></div>

भानु_३|भानु|భాను_౩|భాను|ಭಾನು_೩|ಭಾನು|bhānu_3|bhānu|bhaanu_3|bhaanu|_pe_@1034|_pe_pn116R
