त">mahābhārata</a> battle he fought against <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भीम">bhīma</a> and died. (Śloka 24, Chapter 157, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="द्रोण पर्व">droṇa parva</a>, M.B.).</div></div></div>

