पूरु">pūru</a> line. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="दिवोदास">divodāsa</a> got a son named <a class="pe_a_pada" href="प्रतर्दन">pratardana</a>. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भर्ग">bharga</a> and <a class="pe_a_pada" href="वत्स">vatsa</a> were the sons of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="प्रतर्दन">pratardana</a>. (Chapter 278, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अग्नि">agni</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुराण">purāṇa</a>).</div></div></div>

