a> by <a class="pe_a_pada" href="विप्रचित्ति">vipracitti</a>. Paraśu-<a class="pe_a_pada" href="राम">rāma</a> killed him. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="ब्रह्माण्ड">brahmāṇḍa</a>--3-6-18-22).</div></div></div>

