ष्यरामायण">bhaviṣyarāmāyaṇa</a> being sung by <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कुश">kuśa</a> and <a class="pe_a_pada" href="लव">lava</a> in the presence of Śrī <a class="pe_a_pada" href="राम">rāma</a>.</div></div></div>

भावुक|భావుక|ಭಾವುಕ|bhāvuka|bhaavuka|_pe_@1118|_pe_pn128R
