 class="pe_a_pada" href="जयद्रथ">jayadratha</a>. It was this <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भयंकर">bhayaṅkara</a> who followed <a class="pe_a_pada" href="जयद्रथ">jayadratha</a> with his flag when he was trying to kidnap <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पाञ्चाली">pāñcālī</a>. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अर्जुन">arjuna</a> killed him. (Chapter 265 and 271, Vana Parva, M.B.).</div></div></div>

