a" href="आयुर्वेद">āyurveda</a> ācārya. He was a contemporary of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अग्निवेश">agniveśa</a> and has composed a work on <a class="pe_a_pada" href="आयुर्वेद">āyurveda</a>, entitled ‘Bhelasaṁhitā’.</div></div></div>

