ss="pe_a_pada" href="यम">yama</a> serving the latter. (Sabhā Parva, Chapter 8, Verse 21).</div></div></div>

भीमाक्ष|భీమాక్ష|ಭೀಮಾಕ್ಷ|bhīmākṣa|bhiimaakSha|bheemaakSha|bhiimaaxa|_pe_@1147|_pe_pn134L
