="pe_a_pada" href="कोसल">kosala</a> often. Finally the above kings jointly encountered him. He was killed by King Haryaśvan. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="ब्रह्माण्ड">brahmāṇḍa</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुराण">purāṇa</a>).</div></div></div>

