 class="pe_a_pada" href="केतुमान्">ketumān</a> and <a class="pe_a_pada" href="दिवोदास">divodāsa</a> his son. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="भागवत">bhāgavata</a>, Navama <a class="pe_a_pada" href="स्कन्ध">skandha</a>).</div></div></div>

