ose who bathe in this river will vanish. On its shore is a sacred place called Paṇḍharapura. (Vana Parva, Chapter 88, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भीष्म पर्व">bhīṣma parva</a>, Chapter 9).</div></div></div>

