 Sabhā Parva, Dākṣiṇātya Pāṭha, Chapter 38).</div></div></div>

भोगवती_३|भोगवती|భోగవతీ_౩|భోగవతీ|ಭೋಗವತೀ_೩|ಭೋಗವತೀ|bhogavatī_3|bhogavatī|bhogavatii_3|bhogavatii|bhogavatee_3|bhogavatee|_pe_@1164|_pe_pn138R
