 class="pe_a_pada" href="वासुकि">vāsuki</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="तीर्थ">tīrtha</a>. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="महाभारत">mahābhārata</a> Vana Parva, Chapter 85 says that a bath at this <a class="pe_a_pada" href="तीर्थ">tīrtha</a> is as efficacious as an <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अश्वमेध">aśvamedha</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="यज्ञ">yajña</a>.</div></div></div>

भोगवती_४|भोगवती|భోగవతీ_౪|భోగవతీ|ಭೋಗವತೀ_೪|ಭೋಗವತೀ|bhogavatī_4|bhogavatī|bhogavatii_4|bhogavatii|bhogavatee_4|bhogavatee|_pe_@1165|_pe_pn138R
