hapter 24, Verse 20).</div></div></div>

भोगवती_५|भोगवती|భోగవతీ_౫|భోగవతీ|ಭೋಗವತೀ_೫|ಭೋಗವತೀ|bhogavatī_5|bhogavatī|bhogavatii_5|bhogavatii|bhogavatee_5|bhogavatee|_pe_@1166|_pe_pn138R
