a" href="कुरु">kuru</a>, a King of the Lunar dynasty and son of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="धृतराष्ट्र">dhṛtarāṣṭra</a>, mentioned in Mahā <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भारत">bhārata</a>, Ādi Parva, Chapter 94, Verse 59.</div></div></div>

भूमन्यु_३|भूमन्यु|భూమన్యు_౩|భూమన్యు|ಭೂಮನ್ಯು_೩|ಭೂಮನ್ಯು|bhūmanyu_3|bhūmanyu|bhuumanyu_3|bhuumanyu|bhoomanyu_3|bhoomanyu|_pe_@1194|_pe_pn142L
