s position in the centre of the “Garuḍa Vyūha” (Name of a phalanx) formed by <a class="pe_a_pada" href="द्रोण">droṇa</a>. (M.B. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="द्रोण पर्व">droṇa parva</a>, Chapter 20, Verse 13).</div></div></div>

