">india</a>. He was born from a portion of an <a class="pe_a_pada" href="असुर">asura</a> called <a class="pe_a_pada" href="क्रोधवश">krodhavaśa</a>. (M.B. Ādi Parva, Chapter 67, Verse 61).</div></div></div>

