">śānti</a> Parva, Chapter 166, verse 75 says that King <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अमूर्तरयस्">amūrtarayas</a> gave a sword to <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भूमिशय">bhūmiśaya</a> who gifted it to <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भरत">bharata</a>, the son of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="दुष्यन्त">duṣyanta</a>.</div></div></div>

