s different from the actual <a class="pe_a_pada" href="इन्द्र">indra</a>. There is reference to this <a class="pe_a_pada" href="इन्द्र">indra</a> in <a class="pe_a_pada" href="महाभारत">mahābhārata</a>, Ādi Parva, Chapter 96, Verse 28.</div></div></div>

भूतज्योति|భూతజ్యోతి|ಭೂತಜ್ಯೋತಿ|bhūtajyoti|bhuutajyoti|bhootajyoti|_pe_@1216|_pe_pn145L
