ss="pe_a_pada" href="अष्टवसुस्">aṣṭavasus</a>. A son named <a class="pe_a_pada" href="विश्वकर्मा">viśvakarmā</a> was born to them. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="ब्रह्माण्ड">brahmāṇḍa</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुराण">purāṇa</a>, 3-3-2129).</div></div></div>

