ति">prajāpati</a> of his wife <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कद्रू">kadrū</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="महाभारत">mahābhārata</a>, Ādi Parva, Chapter 35, Stanza 12).</div></div></div>

