 href="प्रजापति">prajāpati</a>. (M.B. Udyoga Parva, Chapter 103, Stanza 14).</div></div></div>

बिल्वतेज|బిల్వతేజ|ಬಿಲ್ವತೇಜ|bilvateja|_pe_@1238|_pe_pn146L
