on is made that this King fled to South <a class="pe_a_pada" href="इन्दिअ">india</a> with his brothers and relatives fearing the attack of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="जरासन्ध">jarāsandha</a>.</div></div></div>

बोधम्|बोध|बोधं|బోధమ్|బోధ|బోధం|ಬೋಧಮ್|ಬೋಧ|ಬೋಧಂ|bodham|bodha|_pe_@1243|_pe_pn146R
