nstruction work. In the Ṛg <a class="pe_a_pada" href="वेद">veda</a> and Sāṁkhyāyana Śrauta <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सूत्र">sūtra</a> mention is made that this king offered plenty of presents to the hermit <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भरद्वाज">bharadvāja</a>.</div></div></div>

बृध्नाश्व|బృధ్నాశ్వ|ಬೃಧ್ನಾಶ್ವ|bṛdhnāśva|bRdhnaashva|bRidhnaashva|bRudhnaashva|bRRidhnaashva|_pe_@1289|_pe_pn160R
