, Vana Parva, Chapter 221, Stanza 9, that <a class="pe_a_pada" href="बृहद्भासा">bṛhadbhāsā</a> was the wife of the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अग्नि">agni</a> (fire) called <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भानु">bhānu</a>.</div></div></div>

