गान्धार">gāndhāra</a>--<a class="pe_a_pada" href="बृहद्धल">bṛhaddhala</a> attended the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पाञ्चाली">pāñcālī</a> Svayamvara (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="मर्रिअगे">marriage</a> of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पाञ्चाली">pāñcālī</a>) with his brother <a class="pe_a_pada" href="शकुनि">śakuni</a> and <a class="pe_a_pada" href="वृषक">vṛṣaka</a>.</div></div></div>

