>agni</a> is the son of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="वसिष्ठ">vasiṣṭha</a> he has got the name <a class="pe_a_pada" href="वसिष्ठ">vasiṣṭha</a> also. A son named Praṇīti was born to this <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अग्नि">agni</a>. (M.B. Vana Parva, Chapter 220).</div></div></div>

