ods). It is mentioned in <a class="pe_a_pada" href="महाभारत">mahābhārata</a> Ādi Parva, Chapter 122, Stanza 57 that this <a class="pe_a_pada" href="गन्धर्व">gandharva</a> was present at the Birthday celebration of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अर्जुन">arjuna</a>.</div></div></div>

