 <a class="pe_a_pada" href="क्षेमधूर्ति">kṣemadhūrti</a>. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="बृहन्त">bṛhanta</a> was killed in a fight with <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सात्यकि">sātyaki</a>. (M.B. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कर्ण">karṇa</a> Parva, Chapter 4).</div></div></div>

बृहन्ता|బృహన్తా|ಬೃಹನ್ತಾ|bṛhantā|bRhantaa|bRihantaa|bRuhantaa|bRRihantaa|_pe_@1333|_pe_pn162L
