is time had troubled and harassed him a great deal. Mention is made in <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अथर्व">atharva</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="वेद">veda</a> that the Kṣatriyas met with destruction as a consequence.</div></div></div>

