ss="pe_a_pada" href="क्रोधवश">krodhavaśa</a>, a daitya (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="असुर">asura</a>). <a class="pe_a_pada" href="लक्ष्मणा">lakṣmaṇā</a>, the daughter of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="बृहत्सेन">bṛhatsena</a> was one of the wives of Śrī Kṛsṇa. In the battle of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="महाभारत">mahābhārata</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="बृहत्सेन">bṛhatsena</a> was on the side of the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कौरवस्">kauravas</a>.</div></div></div>

