a" href="पुराण">purāṇa</a> that <a class="pe_a_pada" href="नारद">nārada</a> had taught <a class="pe_a_pada" href="बृहत्सेन">bṛhatsena</a>, Brahmavidyā (theosophy).</div></div></div>

