ुब्रह्मण्य">subrahmaṇya</a> by <a class="pe_a_pada" href="विष्णु">viṣṇu</a>, the other two being <a class="pe_a_pada" href="संक्रम">saṅkrama</a> and Atikrama. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="शल्य">śalya</a> Parva, Chapter 45, Verse 40).</div></div></div>

