>indra</a> performed a <a class="pe_a_pada" href="यज्ञ">yajña</a> on this <a class="pe_a_pada" href="मोउन्तैन्">mountain</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="शान्ति">śānti</a> Parva, Chapter 4, Verse 185).</div></div></div>

