pher in ancient <a class="pe_a_pada" href="इन्दिअ">india</a>. He was an atheist. He controverted in a powerful manner the belief in the existence of heaven and hell after <a class="pe_a_pada" href="देअथ्">death</a>.</div></div></div>

चार्वांगी|चार्वाङ्गी|చార్వాంగీ|చార్వాఙ్గీ|ಚಾರ್ವಾಂಗೀ|ಚಾರ್ವಾಙ್ಗೀ|cārvāṅgī|chaarvaaMgii|chaarvaaMgee|chaarvaangii|chaarvaangee|_pe_@1497|_pe_pn178R
