of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पृथुलाक्ष">pṛthulākṣa</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="अग्नि">agni</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुराण">purāṇa</a>, Chapter 277).</div></div></div>

