_pada" href="पाण्डवस्">pāṇḍavas</a>. He was killed by <a class="pe_a_pada" href="प्रतिविन्ध्य">prativindhya</a>. (M.B. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कर्ण">karṇa</a> Parva, Chapter 14, Verse 32).</div></div></div>

