st the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कौरवस्">kauravas</a>. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कर्ण">karṇa</a> killed him. (M.B. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कर्ण">karṇa</a> Parva, Chapter 56, Verse 46).</div></div></div>

