 of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="धृतराष्ट्र">dhṛtarāṣṭra</a>. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भीम">bhīma</a> killed him in war. (M.B. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="द्रोण पर्व">droṇa parva</a>, Chapter 137, Verse 27).</div></div></div>

