्">kauravas</a> against the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पाण्डवस्">pāṇḍavas</a> and was killed by <a class="pe_a_pada" href="श्रुतकर्मा">śrutakarmā</a>. (Śloka 14, Chapter 14, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कर्ण">karṇa</a> Parva).</div></div></div>

