_a_pada" href="पाण्डवस्">pāṇḍavas</a> against the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कौरवस्">kauravas</a> and was killed by <a class="pe_a_pada" href="समुद्रसेन">samudrasena</a>. (Śloka 16, Chapter 6, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कर्ण">karṇa</a> Parva)</div></div></div>

