e_a_pada" href="धृतराष्ट्र">dhṛtarāṣṭra</a>. He was slain by Bhīmasena in the great battle. (Śloka 20, Chapter 136, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="द्रोण पर्व">droṇa parva</a>).</div></div></div>

