" href="धृतराष्ट्र">dhṛtarāṣṭra</a>. He was slain by Bhīmasena. (Śloka 29, Chapter 137, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="द्रोण पर्व">droṇa parva</a>).</div></div></div>

