e <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पाण्डवस्">pāṇḍavas</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अर्जुन">arjuna</a> conquered this King. (Śloka 20, Chapter 27, Sabhā Parva).</div></div></div>

