f="अंश">aṁśa</a>. Mention is made about this warrior in <a class="pe_a_pada" href="महाभारत">mahābhārata</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="शल्य">śalya</a> Parva, Chapter 45, Stanza 34.</div></div></div>

