This prince was the brother of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="दमयन्ती">damayantī</a>. (M.B. Vana Parva, Chapter 53, Verse 9).</div></div></div>

दान्ता|దాన్తా|ದಾನ್ತಾ|dāntā|daantaa|_pe_@1735|_pe_pn202L
