उन्तैन्">mountain</a> is said to be sitting in the council hall of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कुबेर">kubera</a> (the god of wealth) and worshipping him, according to Mahā-  <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भारत">bhārata</a>, Sabhā Parva, Chapter 1, Stanza 35.</div></div></div>

