o the sacrificial fire of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="जनमेजय">janamejaya</a> and was burnt to <a class="pe_a_pada" href="देअथ्">death</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="महाभारत">mahābhārata</a>, Ādi Parva, Chapter 57, Stanza 16).</div></div></div>

