e_a_pada" href="दुन्दुभि">dundubhi</a> and father of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="वसु">vasu</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="भागवत">bhāgavata</a>, Navama <a class="pe_a_pada" href="स्कन्ध">skandha</a>).</div></div></div>

