वत">bhāgavata</a>, Pañcama <a class="pe_a_pada" href="स्कन्ध">skandha</a>). For further details about this <a class="pe_a_pada" href="दारुक">dāruka</a>, see under <a class="pe_a_pada" href="घण्टाकर्ण">ghaṇṭākarṇa</a>.</div></div></div>

