ārata</a>, Sabhā Parva, Chapter 52, Stanza 13, it is said that the Kṣatriyas of this family had presented <a class="pe_a_pada" href="धर्मपुत्र">dharmaputra</a> with a large quantity of wealth.</div></div></div>

