of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अश्वमेध">aśvamedha</a> and will attain heaven. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="महाभारत">mahābhārata</a>, Vana Parva, Chapter 84, Stanza 45).</div></div></div>

