_pada" href="सौवीर">sauvīra</a>. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अर्जुन">arjuna</a>, during his conquest of the countries, defeated this King. (M.B. Ādi Parva, Chapter 188, Stanza 20).</div></div></div>

