śi king did tapas. (Udyoga Parva, Chapter 186, Verse 27).</div></div></div>

देवरात_१|देवरात|దేవరాత_౧|దేవరాత|ದೇವರಾತ_೧|ದೇವರಾತ|devarāta_1|devarāta|devaraata_1|devaraata|_pe_@1851|_pe_pn212L
