ef="मुनि">muni</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="विश्रवस्">viśravas</a> married her and to them were born a son  called <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कुबेर">kubera</a>. (See <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कुबेर">kubera</a>).</div></div></div>

