 class="pe_a_pada" href="देववती">devavatī</a> in her previous birth. (See <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सीता">sītā</a> for information for Devavatī's <a class="pe_a_pada" href="देअथ्">death</a> in fire and rebirth as <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सीता">sītā</a>).</div></div></div>

