ss="pe_a_pada" href="कुरुक्षेत्र">kurukṣetra</a> war (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="कर्ण">karṇa</a> Parva, Chapter 85, Verse 3).</div></div></div>

देवावृध_२|देवावृध|దేవావృధ_౨|దేవావృధ|ದೇವಾವೃಧ_೨|ದೇವಾವೃಧ|devāvṛdha_2|devāvṛdha|devaavRdha_2|devaavRdha|devaavRidha_2|devaavRidha|devaavRudha_2|devaavRudha|devaavRRidha_2|devaavRRidha|_pe_@1885|_pe_pn215L
