the supreme Spirit). <a class="pe_a_pada" href="यम">yama</a>, Niyama, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="आसन">āsana</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="प्राणायाम">prāṇāyāma</a>, Pratyāhāra, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="धारणा">dhāraṇā</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="ध्यान">dhyāna</a> and <a class="pe_a_pada" href="समाधि">samādhi</a> are the eight means (See under <a class="pe_a_pada" href="राजयोग">rājayoga</a>).</div></div></div>

