"pe_a_pada" href="हेहय">hehaya</a> and father of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कृति">kṛti</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="ब्रह्माण्ड">brahmāṇḍa</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुराण">purāṇa</a>, Chapter 2).</div></div></div>

