href="यम">yama</a> took the shape of a <a class="pe_a_pada" href="मन्">man</a> and did penance in this place. (M.B. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="द्रोण पर्व">droṇa parva</a>, Chapter 54, Stanza 8).</div></div></div>

