er 75, Stanza 15).</div></div></div>

धृष्णु_२|धृष्णु|ధృష్ణు_౨|ధృష్ణు|ಧೃಷ್ಣು_೨|ಧೃಷ್ಣು|dhṛṣṇu_2|dhṛṣṇu|dhRShNu_2|dhRShNu|dhRiShNu_2|dhRiShNu|dhRuShNu_2|dhRuShNu|dhRRiShNu_2|dhRRiShNu|_pe_@1994|_pe_pn235R
