ष्म पर्व">bhīṣma parva</a>, Chapter 9).</div></div></div>

धृतव्रत|ధృతవ్రత|ಧೃತವ್ರತ|dhṛtavrata|dhRtavrata|dhRitavrata|dhRutavrata|dhRRitavrata|_pe_@2007|_pe_pn238L
