a>. She became the wife of Dharmadeva. Two sons, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="ध्रुव">dhruva</a> and <a class="pe_a_pada" href="धर">dhara</a> were born to the couple. (M.B. Ādi Parva, Chapter 66, Stanza 19).</div></div></div>

