a_pada" href="धृतराष्ट्र">dhṛtarāṣṭra</a>. He was killed by Bhīmasena in the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भारत">bhārata</a> War. (M.B. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="द्रोण पर्व">droṇa parva</a>, Chapter 127).</div></div></div>

