" href="धृतराष्ट्र">dhṛtarāṣṭra</a>. He was killed in the great war by <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भीम">bhīma</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="द्रोण पर्व">droṇa parva</a> Chapter 137, Verse 20).</div></div></div>

