 side of the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पाण्डवस्">pāṇḍavas</a> and was killed by <a class="pe_a_pada" href="द्रोण">droṇa</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="द्रोण पर्व">droṇa parva</a>, Chapter 21, Verse 52).</div></div></div>

