ोपामुद्रा">lopāmudrā</a>. He was born only after remaining in the mother's womb for seven years. He was a very great scholar and <a class="pe_a_pada" href="तपस्वी">tapasvī</a>. He began studying the Vedas from the very time of his birth. He is called <a class="pe_a_pada" href="इध्मवाह">idhmavāha</a> also. (See <a class="pe_a_pada" href="इध्मवाह">idhmavāha</a>).</div></div></div>

