of the hundred sons of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="धृतराष्ट्र">dhṛtarāṣṭra</a>. He was killed by <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भीम">bhīma</a>. (M.B. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="द्रोण पर्व">droṇa parva</a>, Chapter 135, Verse 36).</div></div></div>

