"pe_a_pada" href="भारत">bhārata</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="दुर्योधन">duryodhana</a> ran away from the battlefield and hid himself in this lake. (M.B. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="शल्य">śalya</a> Parva, Chapter 80, Stanza 47).</div></div></div>

