यंवर">svayaṁvara</a> of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="दमयन्ती">damayantī</a> accompanied by <a class="pe_a_pada" href="द्वापर">dvāpara</a>. (See under <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कलि">kali</a>).</div></div></div>

