pada" href="अजमीढ">ajamīḍha</a> and <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुरुमीढ">purumīḍha</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="अग्नि">agni</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुराण">purāṇa</a>, Stanza 278).</div></div></div>

