िजया">vijayā</a> the daughter of this King was the wife of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सहदेव">sahadeva</a>, one of the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पाण्डवस्">pāṇḍavas</a>. (M.B. Ādi Parva, Chapter 95, Stanza 80).</div></div></div>

द्युतिमान्_२|द्युतिमान्|ద్యుతిమాన్_౨|ద్యుతిమాన్|ದ್ಯುತಿಮಾನ್_೨|ದ್ಯುತಿಮಾನ್|dyutimān_2|dyutimān|dyutimaan_2|dyutimaan|_pe_@2246|_pe_pn266R
