f="प्रयाग">prayāga</a>. Bathing in the tirtha is as beneficial as performing <a class="pe_a_pada" href="तेन्">ten</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अश्वमेध">aśvamedha</a> yajñas. (Vana Parva, Chapter 85, Verse 4).</div></div></div>

गांगेय_१|गांगेय|गाङ्गेय_१|गाङ्गेय|గాంగేయ_౧|గాంగేయ|గాఙ్గేయ_౧|గాఙ్గేయ|ಗಾಂಗೇಯ_೧|ಗಾಂಗೇಯ|ಗಾಙ್ಗೇಯ_೧|ಗಾಙ್ಗೇಯ|gāṅgeya_1|gāṅgeya|gaaMgeya_1|gaaMgeya|gaangeya_1|gaangeya|_pe_@2344|_pe_pn279L
