e the results of a <a class="pe_a_pada" href="वाजपेय">vājapeya</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="यज्ञ">yajña</a>, and he who fasts here will become one with the universal soul. (Vana Parva, Chapter 84, Verse 5).</div></div></div>

