pada" href="कृपी">kṛpī</a>).</div></div></div>

गौतमी_२|गौतमी|గౌతమీ_౨|గౌతమీ|ಗೌತಮೀ_೨|ಗೌತಮೀ|gautamī_2|gautamī|gautamii_2|gautamii|gautamee_2|gautamee|_pe_@2385|_pe_pn287L
