the side of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="श्री राम">śrī rāma</a> in the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="राम">rāma</a>-<a class="pe_a_pada" href="रावण">rāvaṇa</a> war. (Vana Parva, Chapter 233, Verse 3).</div></div></div>

