a" href="पूरु">pūru</a> dynasty and son of King Varga. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="गोभानु">gobhānu</a> had a son named <a class="pe_a_pada" href="त्रैशानि">traiśāni</a>. (Chapter 277, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अग्नि">agni</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुराण">purāṇa</a>).</div></div></div>

