 href="अंगारवती">aṅgāravatī</a>. Besides <a class="pe_a_pada" href="गोपालक">gopālaka</a> he had another son named <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पालक">pālaka</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="कथासरित्सागर">kathāsaritsāgara</a>, Kathāmukhalaṁbaka, Taraṅga 3).</div></div></div>

