/a>. (Śloka 44, Chapter 9, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भीष्म">bhīṣma</a> Parva).</div></div></div>

गोपति_१|गोपति|గోపతి_౧|గోపతి|ಗೋಪತಿ_೧|ಗೋಪತಿ|gopati_1|gopati|_pe_@2478|_pe_pn295L
