दिअ">india</a>. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सहदेव">sahadeva</a> captured this <a class="pe_a_pada" href="मोउन्तैन्">mountain</a>. (Śloka 5, Chapter 31, Sabhā Parva).</div></div></div>

