िअ">india</a>. The Laṁśūras gave protection to <a class="pe_a_pada" href="बृहद्रथ">bṛhadratha</a> at this <a class="pe_a_pada" href="मोउन्तैन्">mountain</a>. (Śloka 82, Chapter 49, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="शान्ति">śānti</a> Parva).</div></div></div>

