="pe_a_pada" href="सृष्टि">sṛṣṭi</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पर">para</a> 12.</div></div></div>

हंसचूड|హంసచూడ|ಹಂಸಚೂಡ|haṁsacūḍa|haMsachuuDa|haMsachooDa|_pe_@2563|_pe_pn306R
