ा">brahmā</a>. He was burnt to <a class="pe_a_pada" href="देअथ्">death</a> in the flames emerging from <a class="pe_a_pada" href="शिवलिंग">śivaliṅga</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="स्कन्द">skanda</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुराण">purāṇa</a>, 5, 2, 48).</div></div></div>

