/a>, who got from <a class="pe_a_pada" href="ब्रह्मा">brahmā</a> a boon enabling him to prepare Mṛtasaṅjīvanī. (a medicine to revive dead people). (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="कर्ण">karṇa</a> Parva, Chapter 33, Verse 27).</div></div></div>

