ess to <a class="pe_a_pada" href="इन्द्र">indra</a> in war he got into the hands of his enemies and was killed. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="द्रोण पर्व">droṇa parva</a>, Chapter 52, Verse 27).</div></div></div>

