ns and monkeys originated from this <a class="pe_a_pada" href="हरि">hari</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="वाल्मीकि">vālmīki</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="रामायण">rāmāyaṇa</a>, Araṇyakāṇḍa, Canto 14).</div></div></div>

