a_pada" href="कृष्ण">kṛṣṇa</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="नर">nara</a> and <a class="pe_a_pada" href="नारायण">nārāyaṇa</a> of the daughters of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="दक्ष">dakṣa</a>. (Devi <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भागवत">bhāgavata</a>, 4th <a class="pe_a_pada" href="स्कन्ध">skandha</a>).</div></div></div>

