odhā</a>. She was given in <a class="pe_a_pada" href="मर्रिअगे">marriage</a> to sage <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुलह">pulaha</a> and from them were born the monkeys, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="किन्नरस्">kinnaras</a>, Kiṁpuruṣas etc. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="ब्रह्माण्ड">brahmāṇḍa</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुराण">purāṇa</a>).</div></div></div>

