</a> by <a class="pe_a_pada" href="श्वेता">śvetā</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="ब्रह्माण्ड">brahmāṇḍa</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुराण">purāṇa</a>).</div></div></div>

