 had chanted the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कृष्ण">kṛṣṇa</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="मन्त्र">mantra</a> of twenty letters during his life as sage. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="पद्म">padma</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुराण">purāṇa</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पाताल">pātāla</a> Khaṇḍa, Chapter 72).</div></div></div>

