a" href="सीता">sītā</a> in the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अशोक">aśoka</a> grove. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="वाल्मीकि">vālmīki</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="रामायण">rāmāyaṇa</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सुन्दर">sundara</a> Kāṇḍa, 23, 5). </div></div></div>

