</a> family. It was burnt to <a class="pe_a_pada" href="देअथ्">death</a> at the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सर्पसत्र">sarpasatra</a> of Janamejava. (Ādi Parva, Chapter 57, Verse 11).</div></div></div>

