_pada" href="रघु">raghu</a> a sword with divine powers which he presented to King <a class="pe_a_pada" href="शुनक">śunaka</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="शान्ति">śānti</a> Parva, Chapter 166).</div></div></div>

