>kāśī</a>. He was killed by the sons of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="वीतहव्य">vītahavya</a>. (Anuśāsana Parva, Chapter 30, Verse 10).</div></div></div>

हासिनी|హాసినీ|ಹಾಸಿನೀ|hāsinī|haasinii|haasinee|_pe_@2627|_pe_pn311L
