="pe_a_pada" href="वितल">vitala</a>, a section of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पाताल">pātāla</a> and their semen formed itself into the river called <a class="pe_a_pada" href="हाटकी">hāṭakī</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="भागवत">bhāgavata</a>, 5th <a class="pe_a_pada" href="स्कन्ध">skandha</a>).</div></div></div>

