"pe_a_pada" href="ब्रह्महत्या">brahmahatyā</a> as he killed the sage, Śatārcas. Later on he redeemed himself from the sin by giving water to <a class="pe_a_pada" href="त्रित">trita</a>, a brahmin. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="स्कन्द">skanda</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुराण">purāṇa</a>).</div></div></div>

