f the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पाण्डवस्">pāṇḍavas</a> against the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कौरवस्">kauravas</a>, (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="द्रोण पर्व">droṇa parva</a>, Chapter 23, Verse 67).</div></div></div>

