 as the Heraṁbas. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सहदेव">sahadeva</a>, during his triumphal tour of the South defeated the Heraṁbas. (Sabhā Parva, Chapter 31, Verse 13).<span class="NIvirupu"><br><br></span>HETI. An <a class="pe_a_pada" href="असुर">asura</a>. (See under <a class="pe_a_pada" href="प्रहेति">praheti</a>).</div></div></div>

