 archery was Hiraṇyadhanus's son (See <a class="pe_a_pada" href="एकलव्य">ekalavya</a>).</div></div></div>

हिरण्यगर्भ|హిరణ్యగర్భ|ಹಿರಣ್ಯಗರ್ಭ|hiraṇyagarbha|hiraNyagarbha|_pe_@2686|_pe_pn314R
