nt in the company of nāgas, which carried the soul of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="बलभद्रराम">balabhadrarāma</a> to <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पाताल">pātāla</a>. (Mausala Parva, Chapter 4, Verse 16).</div></div></div>

