्मण्य">subrahmaṇya</a> in the war between the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="देवस्">devas</a> and the Asuras. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="शल्य">śalya</a> Parva, Chapter 46, 75).</div></div></div>

