ंग">aṅga</a>. She was married by the sage <a class="pe_a_pada" href="ऋष्यशृंग">ṛṣyaśṛṅga</a>. (See under <a class="pe_a_pada" href="ऋष्यशृंग">ṛṣyaśṛṅga</a>). (M.B. Vana Parva, Chapter 113, Verse  11). <a class="pe_a_pada" href="इन्द्रसेना">indrasenā</a> served her husband for 100 years. M.B. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="विराट">virāṭa</a> Parva, Chapter 21, Verse 11).</div></div></div>

