was here that <a class="pe_a_pada" href="इन्द्र">indra</a> performed 100 yajñas. (M.B. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="शल्य">śalya</a> Parva, Chapter 48, Verse 49).</div></div></div>

इन्द्रतोया|ఇన్ద్రతోయా|ಇನ್ದ್ರತೋಯಾ|indratoyā|indratoyaa|_pe_@2777|_pe_pn331R
