of this <a class="pe_a_pada" href="मोउन्तैन्">mountain</a> which is connected with <a class="pe_a_pada" href="महामेरु">mahāmeru</a>. (M.B. Vana Parva, Chapter 139, Stanza 16).</div></div></div>

