 class="pe_a_pada" href="उशीरबीज">uśīrabīja</a>. A King named <a class="pe_a_pada" href="मरुत्त">marutta</a>  performed sacrifice on this <a class="pe_a_pada" href="मोउन्तैन्">mountain</a>. (M.B. Udyoga Parva, Chapter 111, Stanza 23).</div></div></div>

