ada" href="पुराण">purāṇa</a> it is mentioned that this <a class="pe_a_pada" href="जान्दकार">jāndakāra</a> is engaged in carrying out the orders of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="यम">yama</a> (the god of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="देअथ्">death</a>).</div></div></div>

