अलम्बुष">alambuṣa</a> who was killed by <a class="pe_a_pada" href="घटोत्कच">ghaṭotkaca</a> in the great war. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="द्रोण पर्व">droṇa parva</a>, Chapter 174).</div></div></div>

