 another <a class="pe_a_pada" href="जयद्रथ">jayadratha</a> who sits in the durbar of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="यम">yama</a> (the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="देअथ्">death</a>-god) and meditates upon him.</div></div></div>

