_pada" href="महाभारत">mahābhārata</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="द्रोण पर्व">droṇa parva</a>, Chapter 156 Stanza 18, that this <a class="pe_a_pada" href="जयानीक">jayānīka</a> was killed by <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अश्वत्थामा">aśvatthāmā</a>.</div></div></div>

जयानीक_२|जयानीक|జయానీక_౨|జయానీక|ಜಯಾನೀಕ_೨|ಜಯಾನೀಕ|jayānīka_2|jayānīka|jayaaniika_2|jayaaniika|jayaaneeka_2|jayaaneeka|_pe_@2955|_pe_pn354L
