d this warrior, who was a prince of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कलिंग">kaliṅga</a>, in the battle of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भारत">bhārata</a>. (M.B. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="द्रोण पर्व">droṇa parva</a>, Chapter 155, Stanza 28).</div></div></div>

