vinda and a daughter named <a class="pe_a_pada" href="मित्रविन्दा">mitravindā</a> by his chief wife <a class="pe_a_pada" href="राजाधिदेवी">rājādhidevī</a>. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="मित्रविन्दा">mitravindā</a> was married by <a class="pe_a_pada" href="श्री कृष्ण">śrī kṛṣṇa</a>.</div></div></div>

