_pada" href="भारत">bhārata</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="द्रोण पर्व">droṇa parva</a>, Chapter 156, Stanza 181 that <a class="pe_a_pada" href="जयाश्व">jayāśva</a> was killed by <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अश्वत्थामा">aśvatthāmā</a> in the battle of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भारत">bhārata</a>.</div></div></div>

जयाश्व_२|जयाश्व|జయాశ్వ_౨|జయాశ్వ|ಜಯಾಶ್ವ_೨|ಜಯಾಶ್ವ|jayāśva_2|jayāśva|jayaashva_2|jayaashva|_pe_@2974|_pe_pn355R
