ada" href="सार्वभौम">sārvabhauma</a> and his mother was the princess <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सुनन्दा">sunandā</a> of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="केकय">kekaya</a>. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="जयत्सेन">jayatsena</a> married <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सुश्रवस्">suśravas</a>, the princess of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="विदर्भ">vidarbha</a>. A son named Arvācīna was born to them. (M.B. Ādi Parva, Chapter 35).</div></div></div>

जयत्सेन_३|जयत्सेन|జయత్సేన_౩|జయత్సేన|ಜಯತ್ಸೇನ_೩|ಜಯತ್ಸೇನ|jayatsena_3|jayatsena|_pe_@2977|_pe_pn356L
