 कृष्ण">śrī kṛṣṇa</a> had won all the battles he fought, he got the name <a class="pe_a_pada" href="जिष्णु">jiṣṇu</a>. (M.B. Udyoga Parva, Chapter 70, Stanza 13).</div></div></div>

जिष्णु_३|जिष्णु|జిష్ణు_౩|జిష్ణు|ಜಿಷ್ಣು_೩|ಜಿಷ್ಣು|jiṣṇu_3|jiṣṇu|jiShNu_3|jiShNu|_pe_@3003|_pe_pn358R
