ought against the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कौरवस्">kauravas</a>. He was a native of the country of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="चेदि">cedi</a>. (M.B. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कर्ण">karṇa</a> Parva, Chapter 56, Stanza 48).</div></div></div>

