y Agnideva. (Fire god). <a class="pe_a_pada" href="ज्योति">jyoti</a> was the other attendant. (M.B. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="शल्य">śalya</a> Parva, Chapter 45, Stanza 33).</div></div></div>

