t once received valuable advice from the Sātvatas called <a class="pe_a_pada" href="बर्हिषद्स्">barhiṣads</a>. (M.B. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="शान्ति">śānti</a> Parva, Chapter 348, Stanza 46).</div></div></div>

