 <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अग्नि">agni</a> (fire). The second one was <a class="pe_a_pada" href="ज्वालाजिह्व">jvālājihva</a>. (M.B. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="शल्य">śalya</a> Parva, Chapter 45, Stanza 33).</div></div></div>

