lass="pe_a_pada" href="कश्यप">kaśyapa</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="वाल्मीकि">vālmīki</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="रामायण">rāmāyaṇa</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अरण्य">araṇya</a> Kāṇḍa, Chapter 14).</div></div></div>

