न">arjuna</a> on his way to <a class="pe_a_pada" href="शिव">śiva</a> with <a class="pe_a_pada" href="श्री कृष्ण">śrī kṛṣṇa</a> during their dreamjourney. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="द्रोण पर्व">droṇa parva</a>, Chapter 80).</div></div></div>

