="स्कन्द">skanda</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुराण">purāṇa</a> there is a story that he conquered heaven, drove away the Dikpālakas, posted his own forces in their place and was finally killed by <a class="pe_a_pada" href="देवी">devī</a>.</div></div></div>

