rse she was born as the daughter of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="परोपकारी">paropakārī</a>, King of the city of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="वर्धमान">vardhamāna</a>. A brahmin named Śaktideva married her. (Caturdārikālambaka, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कथासरित्सागर">kathāsaritsāgara</a>, Taraṅga 1).</div></div></div>

