is prince was present at the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="स्वयंवर">svayaṁvara</a> of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="द्रौपदी">draupadī</a>. (Śloka 185, Chapter 67, Ādi Parva).</div></div></div>

