="कर्ण">karṇa</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="शिबि">śibi</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अष्टक">aṣṭaka</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="प्रतर्दन">pratardana</a>, and <a class="pe_a_pada" href="वसुमान्">vasumān</a> were Kānīnas.</div></div></div>

