e: <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कृतवर्मा">kṛtavarmā</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अनाधृष्टि">anādhṛṣṭi</a>, Samīka, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="समितिञ्जय">samitiñjaya</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कंक">kaṅka</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="शंकु">śaṅku</a> and <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कुन्ति">kunti</a>. (Chapter 14, Sabhā Parva).</div></div></div>

