pe_a_pada" href="कपिल">kapila</a> stayed here for some time. If one bathes in a pond there one will acquire the art of becoming invisible to others (Chapter 83, Vana Parva, M.B.).</div></div></div>

कापिलशास्त्र|కాపిలశాస్త్ర|ಕಾಪಿಲಶಾಸ್ತ್ರ|kāpilaśāstra|kaapilashaastra|_pe_@3287|_pe_pn389L
