āstra <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कपिल">kapila</a> communicated it to his mother Devahūti. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="देवी">devī</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भागवत">bhāgavata</a> 8th <a class="pe_a_pada" href="स्कन्ध">skandha</a>).</div></div></div>

