"शिबि">śibi</a> who was greatly devoted to his dependants, (For genealogy see under <a class="pe_a_pada" href="शिबि">śibi</a>). He had another name Audbhida. (Chapter 197, Vana Parva). He was a prominent member of the court of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="वरुण">varuṇa</a>. (Śanti Parva).</div></div></div>

करभ|కరభ|ಕರಭ|karabha|_pe_@3298|_pe_pn389R
