ritual knowledge to these present at the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="यज्ञ">yajña</a> of the King of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="विदेह">videha</a>. (Skandhas 4 and 5, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भागवत">bhāgavata</a>).</div></div></div>

