_pada" href="सुमेरु">sumeru</a>. All the six seasons appear there at the same time and so this forest is always filled with flowers. (Chapter 6, Śloka 24, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भीष्म पर्व">bhīṣma parva</a>).</div></div></div>

