 in the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="राजसूय">rājasūya</a> of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="युधिष्ठिर">yudhiṣṭhira</a>. (M.B. Sabhā Parva, Chapter 51, Verse 8).</div></div></div>

