nied by his brothers performed penance on the shores of the river <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कालिन्दी">kālindī</a>, to propitiate <a class="pe_a_pada" href="देवी">devī</a>, taking in only air. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="देवी">devī</a> was pleased and appearing before him in person said “You will become the lord of Manvantara”. (Skandhas 10 and 13, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="देवी">devī</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भागवत">bhāgavata</a>). </div></div></div>

कारूष_१|कारूष|కారూష_౧|కారూష|ಕಾರೂಷ_೧|ಕಾರೂಷ|kārūṣa_1|kārūṣa|kaaruuSha_1|kaaruuSha|kaarooSha_1|kaarooSha|_pe_@3374|_pe_pn395R
