led <a class="pe_a_pada" href="काश्यप">kāśyapa</a> by hitting him with his chariot. (See under <a class="pe_a_pada" href="इन्द्र">indra</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पर">para</a> 38).</div></div></div>

