ada" href="महाभारत">mahābhārata</a>, Ādi Parva, Chapter 224, Stanza 23, that this club was given to <a class="pe_a_pada" href="श्री कृष्ण">śrī kṛṣṇa</a> by <a class="pe_a_pada" href="वरुण">varuṇa</a> the god of water, at the time of the burning of the forest Khāṇḍava.</div></div></div>

