a class="pe_a_pada" href="देअथ्">death</a> in the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सर्प">sarpa</a> Sattra (sacrificial fire to kill serpents) of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="जनमेजय">janamejaya</a>. (M.B. Ādi Parva, Chapter 57, Stanza 6).</div></div></div>

