53, Stanza 4, that this Brahmin was present at the ‘Sarpa Sattra’ (sacrifice to kill serpents) of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="जनमेजय">janamejaya</a>. Once <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भगीरथ">bhagīratha</a> gave this hermit as alms one lakh of cows with calves. (M.B. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अनुशासन पर्व">anuśāsana parva</a>, Chapter 138, Stanza 27).</div></div></div>

