अ">india</a>. It is mentioned in <a class="pe_a_pada" href="महाभारत">mahābhārata</a>, Sabhā Parva, that at the time of the regional conquest of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अर्जुन">arjuna</a>, this King fell at his feet and sought refuge.</div></div></div>

