hārata</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="शल्य">śalya</a> Parva, Chapter 45, Stanza 73).</div></div></div>

कोलगिरि|కోలగిరి|ಕೋಲಗಿರಿ|kolagiri|_pe_@3577|_pe_pn414L
