 href="असुर">asura</a> called <a class="pe_a_pada" href="क्रोधवश">krodhavaśa</a>. (M.B. Ādi Parva, Chapter 67, Stanza 61). See under <a class="pe_a_pada" href="ज्यामघ">jyāmagha</a>.</div></div></div>

क्रथ_२|क्रथ|క్రథ_౨|క్రథ|ಕ್ರಥ_೨|ಕ್ರಥ|kratha_2|kratha|_pe_@3604|_pe_pn416R
