</a> reached the world of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="देवस्">devas</a> he had to fight with this <a class="pe_a_pada" href="यक्ष">yakṣa</a>. (M.B. Ādi Parva, Chapter 32, Stanza 18).</div></div></div>

