भारत">mahābhārata</a>, Ādi Parva, Chapter 67 Stanza 57 that this <a class="pe_a_pada" href="असुर">asura</a> was born as King <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सूर्याक्ष">sūryākṣa</a> on the earth in his re-birth.</div></div></div>

