> sons whom King <a class="pe_a_pada" href="रौद्राश्व">raudrāśva</a> of the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुरु">puru</a> dynasty begot of the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अप्सरस्">apsaras</a> called <a class="pe_a_pada" href="मिश्रकेशी">miśrakeśī</a>. (Ādi Parva, Chapter 94, Verse 10).</div></div></div>

