"उशीनर">uśīnara</a> had five wives named Nṛgā, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="नरा">narā</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कृमी">kṛmī</a>, Daśā and <a class="pe_a_pada" href="दृषद्वती">dṛṣadvatī</a>, and of them were born respective-  ly the sons <a class="pe_a_pada" href="नृग">nṛga</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="नर">nara</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कृमि">kṛmi</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सुव्रत">suvrata</a> and <a class="pe_a_pada" href="शिबि">śibi</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="अग्नि">agni</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुराण">purāṇa</a>, Chapter 227).</div></div></div>

