प्रजापति">prajāpati</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कश्यप">kaśyapa</a> of his wife <a class="pe_a_pada" href="काला">kālā</a>. (M.B. Ādi Parva, Chapter 65, Stanza 35).</div></div></div>

