Verse 17).<span class="Pvirupu"><br></span>Once he came down to earth in Indra's Vimāna to witness <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अर्जुन">arjuna</a>, in the company of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="उत्तर">uttara</a>, the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="विराट">virāṭa</a> prince, fight during the lifting of cows. (Sabhā Parva, Chapter 56).</div></div></div>

