> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="इस्लन्द्">island</a> very dear to <a class="pe_a_pada" href="विष्णु">viṣṇu</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="भीष्म पर्व">bhīṣma parva</a>, Chapter 12, Verse 4).</div></div></div>

