grasped the whole of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="आयुर्वेद">āyurveda</a> and practised it by the strength of his penance (M.B. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="शान्ति">śānti</a> Parva, Chapter 210, Verse 21).</div></div></div>

