ि">agni</a> was addressed by this word at the serpent <a class="pe_a_pada" href="यज्ञ">yajña</a> by <a class="pe_a_pada" href="आस्तीक">āstīka</a>. (M.B. Chapter 55, Verse 10).</div></div></div>

