rive the benefits of conducting a <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुण्डरीक">puṇḍarīka</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="यज्ञ">yajña</a>. (Vana Parva, Chapter 83, Verse 21).</div></div></div>

