logy see under <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कार्तवीर्य">kārtavīrya</a>). He got a <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सोम">soma</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="यज्ञ">yajña</a> conducted by the sages of the family of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भृगु">bhṛgu</a> and gave away a lot of wealth to people of Bhṛgu's family (Ādi Parva, Chapter 177, Verse 18). <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कृतवीर्य">kṛtavīrya</a> was a member of the court of Yamarāja. (Sabhā Parva, Chapter 8, Verse 9).</div></div></div>

