ns. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="अनुशासन पर्व">anuśāsana parva</a>, Chapter 25, Verse 22).</div></div></div>

कृत्तिकाश्रम|కృత్తికాశ్రమ|ಕೃತ್ತಿಕಾಶ್ರಮ|kṛttikāśrama|kRttikaashrama|kRittikaashrama|kRuttikaashrama|kRRittikaashrama|_pe_@3709|_pe_pn432L
