pada" href="नरसिंह">narasiṁha</a> (the lion-<a class="pe_a_pada" href="मन्">man</a> incarnation of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="विष्णु">viṣṇu</a>) (4) <a class="pe_a_pada" href="हरि">hari</a> (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="विष्णु">viṣṇu</a>) (5) Protector of temples and gate keeper. (6) Lightning (7) Destruction (8) A demon.</div></div></div>

