class="pe_a_pada" href="थ्रेए">three</a> sons <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कर्दम">kardama</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="उर्वरीयान्">urvarīyān</a> and <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सहिष्णु">sahiṣṇu</a> were born to <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुलह">pulaha</a> of his wife <a class="pe_a_pada" href="क्षमा">kṣamā</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="विष्णु">viṣṇu</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुराण">purāṇa</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अंश">aṁśa</a> 1, Stanza 10).</div></div></div>

