his archer led <a class="pe_a_pada" href="दुर्योधन">duryodhana</a> in the battlefield. (M.B. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भीष्म पर्व">bhīṣma parva</a>, Chapter 17, Stanza 27).</div></div></div>

क्षेमधूर्ति|క్షేమధూర్తి|ಕ್ಷೇಮಧೂರ್ತಿ|kṣemadhūrti|kShemadhuurti|kShemadhoorti|xemadhuurti|_pe_@3730|_pe_pn433R
