 who was the brother of Bṛhantaka, fought with <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सात्यकि">sātyaki</a> in the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भारत">bhārata</a> battle. (M.B. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="शल्य">śalya</a> Parva, Chapter 21, Stanza 8).</div></div></div>

