Mention is made in <a class="pe_a_pada" href="महाभारत">mahābhārata</a>, Udyoga Parva, Chapter 4, Stanza 24, that the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पाण्डवस्">pāṇḍavas</a> had sent invitation to this King for the battle of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भारत">bhārata</a>.</div></div></div>

