f="श्रेणिमान्">śreṇimān</a> of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कुमार">kumāra</a> was defeated by <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भीम">bhīma</a> during his triumphal tour. (Sabhā Parva, Chapter 30, Verse 1).</div></div></div>

