kumāra</a> and <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सनत्सुजात">sanatsujāta</a> were the sons of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="ब्रह्मा">brahmā</a> endowed with eternal youthfulness. They are known as the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कुमारस्">kumāras</a>.</div></div></div>

