</span>  . <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भरद्वाज">bharadvāja</a>, the first son of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="शंयु">śaṁyu</a> married <a class="pe_a_pada" href="वीरा">vīrā</a>, and an Agnideva was born as their son. This <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अग्नि">agni</a> is known by the names <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कुम्भरेतस्">kumbharetas</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="रथप्रभु">rathaprabhu</a> and <a class="pe_a_pada" href="रथध्वान">rathadhvāna</a>. (M.B. Vana Parva, Chapter 220, Verse 9).</div></div></div>

