ākṣasa</a>, by <a class="pe_a_pada" href="केतुमती">ketumatī</a>. She was abducted by the King of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="मथुरा">mathurā</a>  called Madhupa. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="रावण">rāvaṇa</a> killed him. (See under Madhupa).</div></div></div>

कुम्भीनस|कुंभीनस|కుమ్భీనస|కుంభీనస|ಕುಮ್ಭೀನಸ|ಕುಂಭೀನಸ|kumbhīnasa|kumbhiinasa|kumbheenasa|_pe_@3814|_pe_pn440R
