r being <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कुसुम">kusuma</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कुमुद">kumuda</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="डम्बर">ḍambara</a> and <a class="pe_a_pada" href="आडम्बर">āḍambara</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="शल्य">śalya</a>, Parva, Chapter 45, Verse 38). </div></div></div>

