da" href="कुण्डाशी">kuṇḍāśī</a>. He was killed by <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भीम">bhīma</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="भीष्म">bhīṣma</a>. Parva, Chapter 96, Verse 24).</div></div></div>

