a> mother of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="हनूमान्">hanūmān</a> was the daughter of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कुञ्जर">kuñjara</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="वाल्मीकि">vālmīki</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="रामायण">rāmāyaṇa</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="किष्किन्धा">kiṣkindhā</a> Kāṇḍa; Canto 66, Verse 9).</div></div></div>

