href="पाञ्चाल">pāñcāla</a> in ancient <a class="pe_a_pada" href="इन्दिअ">india</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="भीष्म पर्व">bhīṣma parva</a> Chapter 9, Verse 56).</div></div></div>

