_a_pada" href="कुन्द">kunda</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कुसुम">kusuma</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कुमुद">kumuda</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="डम्बर">ḍambara</a> and <a class="pe_a_pada" href="आडम्बर">āḍambara</a> were the five attendants. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="शल्य">śalya</a> Parva, Chapter 45, Verse 39).</div></div></div>

