कृष्ण">śrī kṛṣṇa</a> and <a class="pe_a_pada" href="बलभद्रराम">balabhadrarāma</a>, who went there to witness the dhanuryajña. But, they killed the elephant.<blockquote class="pe_padyam"><pre>Raṅgadvāraṁ samāsādya<br>Tasmin nāgamavasthitam  ।<br>Apaśyat Kuvalayāpīḍaṁ<br>Kṛṣṇo smbaṣṭhapracoditam  ।।</pre></blockquote> (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="भागवत">bhāgavata</a>, Daśama <a class="pe_a_pada" href="स्कन्ध">skandha</a>, Chapter 48, Verse 2).</div></div></div>

