ा">śraddhā</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="लक्ष्मी">lakṣmī</a>, etc. (Chapter 7, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अंश">aṁśa</a> 1, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="विष्णु">viṣṇu</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुराण">purāṇa</a>).</div></div></div>

