" href="तेन्">ten</a> of them were married to Dharmadeva. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="लम्बा">lambā</a> was one of them. (Chapter 15, Aṁsa 1, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="विष्णु">viṣṇu</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुराण">purāṇa</a>).</div></div></div>

