"रामणीयक">rāmaṇīyaka</a>. He had come to the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="इस्लन्द्">island</a> long before the serpents came to that place. The serpents saw him when they went there to live. (Śloka 2, Chapter 27, Ādi Parva).</div></div></div>

लवण_४|लवण|లవణ_౪|లవణ|ಲವಣ_೪|ಲವಣ|lavaṇa_4|lavaṇa|lavaNa_4|lavaNa|_pe_@3985|_pe_pn453L
