s that this King had participated in several <a class="pe_a_pada" href="राजसूय">rājasūya</a> yajñas.</div></div></div>

लावानक|लावाणक|లావానక|లావాణక|ಲಾವಾನಕ|ಲಾವಾಣಕ|lāvānaka|lāvāṇaka|laavaanaka|laavaaNaka|_pe_@3986|_pe_pn453L
