s divided into eight parts. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="मणिप्रवाल">maṇipravāla</a>, Malayālaśabdas, Alaṅkāra, Kāvyaguṇas, Kāvyadoṣas and Rasa are critically examined in this book.</div></div></div>

