ous demons like <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पञ्चज">pañcaja</a> and <a class="pe_a_pada" href="विरूपाक्ष">virūpākṣa</a> at this place. (Chapter 33, Dākṣiṇātya Pāṭha, Sabhā Parva).</div></div></div>

