a" href="ब्रह्मा">brahmā</a>. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="मत्स्य">matsya</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुराण">purāṇa</a> states that <a class="pe_a_pada" href="मद">mada</a> was born of the Pride of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="ब्रह्मा">brahmā</a>.</div></div></div>

