ss="pe_a_pada" href="असुर">asura</a> named <a class="pe_a_pada" href="मधु">madhu</a> he was called <a class="pe_a_pada" href="मधुसूदन">madhusūdana</a>. (Śloka 16, Chapter 207, Vana Parva).</div></div></div>

