a_pada" href="सर्ग">sarga</a> 62, Bāla Kāṇḍa, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="वाल्मीकि">vālmīki</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="रामायण">rāmāyaṇa</a>).</div></div></div>

