_pada" href="सुग्रीव">sugrīva</a>. After finding out the whereabouts of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सीता">sītā</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="हनूमान्">hanūmān</a> and <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अंगद">aṅgada</a> accompanied by other monkeys entered this garden and drank honey to their heart's content. (Chapter 282. Vana Parva and <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सुन्दर">sundara</a> Kāṇḍa, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="वाल्मीकि">vālmīki</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="रामायण">rāmāyaṇa</a>).</div></div></div>

