 in a sacred pond there and worships the Manes one will have to one's credit the benefit of making a thousand Godānas (giving away cows in charity). (Śloka 94, Chapter 83, Vana Parva).</div></div></div>

मधुविद्या|మధువిద్యా|ಮಧುವಿದ್ಯಾ|madhuvidyā|madhuvidyaa|_pe_@4064|_pe_pn459R
