bhārata</a>. He was born of the partial spirit of the demon <a class="pe_a_pada" href="क्रोधवश">krodhavaśa</a>. Śloka 59, Chapter 67, Ādi Parva).</div></div></div>

मद्रक_२|मद्रक|మద్రక_౨|మద్రక|ಮದ್ರಕ_೨|ಮದ್ರಕ|madraka_2|madraka|_pe_@4073|_pe_pn460L
