rma</a> by his wife <a class="pe_a_pada" href="निरृति">nirṛti</a>. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="महाभय">mahābhaya</a> had two brothers named <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भय">bhaya</a> and <a class="pe_a_pada" href="मृत्यु">mṛtyu</a>. (M.B. Ādi Parva, Chapter 66, Verse 54).</div></div></div>

