, Verse 48 says that one who takes bath here and spends a month fasting with a pure heart will attain salvation.</div></div></div>

महाजानु|మహాజాను|ಮಹಾಜಾನು|mahājānu|mahaajaanu|_pe_@4109|_pe_pn462L
