dvarā</a> lay bitten by a serpent, this <a class="pe_a_pada" href="ब्राह्मण">brāhmaṇa</a> came near her with tearful eyes. (See under <a class="pe_a_pada" href="प्रमद्वरा">pramadvarā</a>).</div></div></div>

