s="pe_a_pada" href="वासुकि">vāsuki</a>, the King of serpents. The other one was <a class="pe_a_pada" href="जय">jaya</a>. (M.B. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="शल्य">śalya</a> Parva. Chapter 45, Verse 52).</div></div></div>

