a>, the son of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="नरिष्यन्त">nariṣyanta</a> killed <a class="pe_a_pada" href="महानन्द">mahānanda</a> at the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="स्वयंवर">svayaṁvara</a> of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सुमना">sumanā</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="मार्कण्डेय">mārkaṇḍeya</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुराण">purāṇa</a>, 130. 52).</div></div></div>

