ween <a class="pe_a_pada" href="राम">rāma</a> and <a class="pe_a_pada" href="रावण">rāvaṇa</a>, all those warriors were killed. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="अग्नि">agni</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुराण">purāṇa</a>, Chapter 11).</div></div></div>

