he top of Mount <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कैलास">kailāsa</a>. There is a reference to this <a class="pe_a_pada" href="मोउन्तैन्">mountain</a> in <a class="pe_a_pada" href="महाभारत">mahābhārata</a>, Anuśāsana Parva, Chapter 19, Verse 21.</div></div></div>

