ch describes the Mahāprasthāna conducted by the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पाण्डवस्">pāṇḍavas</a> after the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भारत">bhārata</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="युद्ध">yuddha</a>.</div></div></div>

