घटोत्कच">ghaṭotkaca</a>. He was killed by <a class="pe_a_pada" href="दुर्योधन">duryodhana</a> at the battle  of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कुरुक्षेत्र">kurukṣetra</a>. (M.B. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भीष्म पर्व">bhīṣma parva</a>, Chapter 91, Verse 20).</div></div></div>

