>, Sabhā Parva, Chapter 9 states that this <a class="pe_a_pada" href="नाग">nāga</a> worships <a class="pe_a_pada" href="वरुण">varuṇa</a> in Varuṇa's assembly.</div></div></div>

महाश्रम|మహాశ్రమ|ಮಹಾಶ್ರಮ|mahāśrama|mahaashrama|_pe_@4161|_pe_pn464L
