 a person who spends a  night here observing a fast, would obtain “Śubhaloka”. One who spends <a class="pe_a_pada" href="थ्रेए">three</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="मोन्थ्स्">months</a> like that will become a “Paramasiddha”. (M.B. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अनुशासन पर्व">anuśāsana parva</a>, Chapter 25, Verse 17).</div></div></div>

