ref="सुब्रह्मण्य">subrahmaṇya</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="स्कन्द">skanda</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुराण">purāṇa</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="असुर">asura</a> Kāṇḍa).</div></div></div>

