 <a class="pe_a_pada" href="महावीर">mahāvīra</a>, who was the re-birth of the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="असुर">asura</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="क्रोधवश">krodhavaśa</a>.</div></div></div>

