 the ocean as the perspiration drops fell on her from <a class="pe_a_pada" href="हनूमान्">hanūmān</a>. (Sārakāṇḍa, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="आनन्द">ānanda</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="रामायण">rāmāyaṇa</a>).</div></div></div>

