n as <a class="pe_a_pada" href="विष्णु">viṣṇu</a> in the month of Kārttika. (November) (12th <a class="pe_a_pada" href="स्कन्ध">skandha</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भागवत">bhāgavata</a>).</div></div></div>

