"काञ्ची">kāñcī</a>. This <a class="pe_a_pada" href="मानवरा">mānavarā</a> divorced her husband to marry one who was more wealthy. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="कथासरित्सागर">kathāsaritsāgara</a>).</div></div></div>

