href="केदार">kedāra</a> mountains in <a class="pe_a_pada" href="उत्तरा">uttarā</a> khaṇḍa. It is also known as Mandāgni and Kālīgaṅgā. (M.B. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भीष्म पर्व">bhīṣma parva</a>, Chapter 89, Verse 34).</div></div></div>

