cquired the name <a class="pe_a_pada" href="मन्दाकिनी">mandākinī</a>. (M.B. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अनुशासन पर्व">anuśāsana parva</a>, Chapter 19, Verse 82).</div></div></div>

