e_a_pada" href="पुलस्त्य">pulastya</a>. A son, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कुबेर">kubera</a> was born to her by the blessing of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="शिव">śiva</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="पद्म">padma</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुराण">purāṇa</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पाताल">pātāla</a> Khaṇḍa). </div></div></div>

