ass="pe_a_pada" href="देअथ्">death</a> in the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सर्पसत्र">sarpasatra</a> of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="जनमेजय">janamejaya</a>. (Śloka 8, Chapter 57, Ādi Parva).</div></div></div>

