pāṇḍavas</a>, used to blow a conch named <a class="pe_a_pada" href="मणिपुष्पक">maṇipuṣpaka</a>. (Śloka 16, Chapter 25, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भीष्म पर्व">bhīṣma parva</a>).</div></div></div>

मणिस्कन्ध|మణిస్కన్ధ|ಮಣಿಸ್ಕನ್ಧ|maṇiskandha|maNiskandha|_pe_@4346|_pe_pn479R
