pent was burnt to <a class="pe_a_pada" href="देअथ्">death</a> in the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सर्पसत्र">sarpasatra</a> of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="जनमेजय">janamejaya</a>. (Chapter 52, Ādi Parva). </div></div></div>

