to a devil. (See under <a class="pe_a_pada" href="मेधावी">medhāvī</a>).</div></div></div>

मंक|मङ्क|మంక|మఙ్క|ಮಂಕ|ಮಙ್ಕ|maṅka|maMka|manka|_pe_@4354|_pe_pn480L
