class="pe_a_pada" href="वर्चस्">varcas</a> was born of her first. Then she had <a class="pe_a_pada" href="थ्रेए">three</a> more sons named <a class="pe_a_pada" href="शिशिर">śiśira</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="प्राण">prāṇa</a> and <a class="pe_a_pada" href="रमण">ramaṇa</a>. (Śloka 22, Chapter 66, Ādi Parva).</div></div></div>

मनोहरा_२|मनोहरा|మనోహరా_౨|మనోహరా|ಮನೋಹರಾ_೨|ಮನೋಹರಾ|manoharā_2|manoharā|manoharaa_2|manoharaa|_pe_@4363|_pe_pn481L
