urt of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कुबेर">kubera</a> this nymph gave a performance in dancing in honour of that sage. (Śloka 45, Chapter 19, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अनुशासन पर्व">anuśāsana parva</a>).</div></div></div>

मनोजव_१|मनोजव|మనోజవ_౧|మనోజవ|ಮನೋಜವ_೧|ಮನೋಜವ|manojava_1|manojava|_pe_@4364|_pe_pn481L
