ष">cākṣuṣa</a>, the sixth <a class="pe_a_pada" href="मनु">manu</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="इन्द्र">indra</a> was <a class="pe_a_pada" href="मनोजव">manojava</a>, the leader of the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="देवस्">devas</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="अंश">aṁśa</a> 3, Chapter 160, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="विष्णु">viṣṇu</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुराण">purāṇa</a>).</div></div></div>

