rga</a> 25, Bālakāṇḍa, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="वाल्मीकि">vālmīki</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="रामायण">rāmāyaṇa</a>). <a class="pe_a_pada" href="इन्द्र">indra</a> killed this <a class="pe_a_pada" href="मन्थरा">mantharā</a>.</div></div></div>

