gavata</a>, 9th <a class="pe_a_pada" href="स्कन्ध">skandha</a> states that <a class="pe_a_pada" href="मन्यु">manyu</a>, the son of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भरद्वाज">bharadvāja</a>, had five sons including Bṛhatkṣaya.</div></div></div>

