शाक">śāka</a>. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="महाभारत">mahābhārata</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भीष्म पर्व">bhīṣma parva</a>, Chapter 11 says that in ancient times, Kings used to live there for the fulfilment of their desires.</div></div></div>

मशर्शार|మశర్శార|ಮಶರ್ಶಾರ|maśarśāra|masharshaara|_pe_@4432|_pe_pn492R
