>śabarī</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="अरण्य">araṇya</a> Kāṇḍa, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="वाल्मीकि">vālmīki</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="रामायण">rāmāyaṇa</a>).</div></div></div>

