 thirtieth part of the earth and this journey of the Sun is called <a class="pe_a_pada" href="मौहूर्त्तिकागति">mauhūrttikāgati</a>. (See under <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सूर्य">sūrya</a>).</div></div></div>

मौञ्जायन|మౌఞ్జాయన|ಮೌಞ್ಜಾಯನ|mauñjāyana|mau~njaayana|_pe_@4465|_pe_pn494R
