lass="pe_a_pada" href="शल्य">śalya</a> Parva).</div></div></div>

मेघपुष्प|మేఘపుష్ప|ಮೇಘಪುಷ್ಪ|meghapuṣpa|meghapuShpa|_pe_@4503|_pe_pn500R
