">meghavarṇa</a> was also present with <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अर्जुन">arjuna</a> when he went to protect the sacrificial horse of the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अश्वमेध">aśvamedha</a> conducted by the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पाण्डवस्">pāṇḍavas</a>.</div></div></div>

