pada" href="राम">rāma</a>-<a class="pe_a_pada" href="रावण">rāvaṇa</a> battle. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="श्री राम">śrī rāma</a> killed this demon. (Chapter 34, Verse 27, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="युद्ध">yuddha</a> Kāṇḍa, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="वाल्मीकि">vālmīki</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="रामायण">rāmāyaṇa</a>).</div></div></div>

मित्रज्ञ|మిత్రజ్ఞ|ಮಿತ್ರಜ್ಞ|mitrajña|mitraj~na|_pe_@4545|_pe_pn504L
