rāma</a>. When <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सुरथ">suratha</a> blocked the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अश्वमेध">aśvamedha</a> horse of Śrī <a class="pe_a_pada" href="राम">rāma</a>, a fight ensued in which <a class="pe_a_pada" href="मोहक">mohaka</a> also took part (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="पद्म">padma</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुराण">purāṇa</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पाताल">pātāla</a> Khaṇḍa). </div></div></div>

