f <a class="pe_a_pada" href="मुण्डक">muṇḍaka</a> and paid homage to the sage <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अगस्त्य">agastya</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="अरण्य">araṇya</a> Kāṇḍa, Kamba <a class="pe_a_pada" href="रामायण">rāmāyaṇa</a>).</div></div></div>

मुण्डवेदांग|मुण्डवेदाङ्ग|ముణ్డవేదాంగ|ముణ్డవేదాఙ్గ|ಮುಣ್ಡವೇದಾಂಗ|ಮುಣ್ಡವೇದಾಙ್ಗ|muṇḍavedāṅga|muNDavedaaMga|muNDavedaanga|_pe_@4611|_pe_pn509L
