ef="युधिष्ठिर">yudhiṣṭhira</a> very much. (Śloka 23, Chapter 26, Vana Parva).</div></div></div>

मुञ्जकेश|ముఞ్జకేశ|ಮುಞ್ಜಕೇಶ|muñjakeśa|mu~njakesha|_pe_@4620|_pe_pn509R
