>bhārata</a>. He was the re-birth of an <a class="pe_a_pada" href="असुर">asura</a> called <a class="pe_a_pada" href="निचन्द्र">nicandra</a>. (Śloka 21, Chapter 67, Ādi Parva). The <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पाण्डवस्">pāṇḍavas</a> had sent an invitation to this King to participate in the great battle. (Śloka 14, Chapter 4, Udyoga Parva).</div></div></div>

