a</a>. This <a class="pe_a_pada" href="असुर">asura</a> was killed by <a class="pe_a_pada" href="बलभद्र">balabhadra</a>. (See under <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कृष्ण">kṛṣṇa</a>).</div></div></div>

