ass="pe_a_pada" href="ब्रह्मा">brahmā</a>. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="लोहिताक्ष">lohitākṣa</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="घण्टाकर्ण">ghaṇṭākarṇa</a> and <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कुमुदमाली">kumudamālī</a> were the other <a class="pe_a_pada" href="थ्रेए">three</a> attendants. (M.B. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="शल्य">śalya</a> Parva, Chapter 45, Stanza 24).</div></div></div>

