म्भकर्ण">kumbhakarṇa</a> (Rāvaṇa's brother) by his wife Vajramālā. He had an elder brother called <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कुम्भ">kumbha</a>.<span class="NIvirupu"><br><br></span>When <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कुम्भ">kumbha</a> was killed in the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="राम">rāma</a>-<a class="pe_a_pada" href="रावण">rāvaṇa</a> war <a class="pe_a_pada" href="निकुम्भ">nikumbha</a> rushed to the front line and fought fiercely, and he was killed by <a class="pe_a_pada" href="हनूमान्">hanūmān</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="वाल्मीकि">vālmīki</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="रामायण">rāmāyaṇa</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="युद्ध">yuddha</a> Kāṇḍa, Canto 77).</div></div></div>

