f="शान्ति">śānti</a> was born to him of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="नीलिनी">nīlinī</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="अग्नि">agni</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुराण">purāṇa</a>, Chapter 278).</div></div></div>

