href="ब्रह्मदत्त">brahmadatta</a> was born to the King by his wife <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कृति">kṛti</a> alias Kīrtimatī. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="ब्रह्मदत्त">brahmadatta</a> begot hundred sons like Kīrtivardhana and all of them became famous by the name Nīpas. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="भागवत">bhāgavata</a>, 9th <a class="pe_a_pada" href="स्कन्ध">skandha</a>).</div></div></div>

