 <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कद्रू">kadrū</a>. (Ādi Parva, Chapter 35, Verse 9).</div></div></div>

निष्ठुरक|నిష్ఠురక|ನಿಷ್ಠುರಕ|niṣṭhuraka|niShThuraka|_pe_@4863|_pe_pn542L
