</a>. Once he had to depend on <a class="pe_a_pada" href="श्रीदत्त">śrīdatta</a>, a King of North <a class="pe_a_pada" href="इन्दिअ">india</a>. (See under <a class="pe_a_pada" href="श्रीदत्त">śrīdatta</a>).</div></div></div>

