ref="ओघरथ">ogharatha</a> and a daughter named <a class="pe_a_pada" href="ओघवती">oghavatī</a>. (M.B. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अनुशासन पर्व">anuśāsana parva</a>, Chapter 2).</div></div></div>

