ter 10, Sabhā Parva). Śaṅkhanidhi, Padmanidhi and a Puṣpakavimāna were presented to <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कुबेर">kubera</a> by <a class="pe_a_pada" href="ब्रह्मा">brahmā</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="उत्तर रामायण">uttara rāmāyaṇa</a>).</div></div></div>

