omatī</a> which flows through Naimiṣāraṇya. This serpent once went to <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भीष्म">bhīṣma</a> and talked to him about <a class="pe_a_pada" href="धर्म">dharma</a>. (Chapter 355, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="शान्ति">śānti</a> Parva).</div></div></div>

