dmāvatī</a> of whom many stories are told in <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कथासरित्सागर">kathāsaritsāgara</a> was the daughter of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पद्मशेखर">padmaśekhara</a>. Padmāvatīlambaka of the said book is entirely devoted to stories about <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पद्मावती">padmāvatī</a>.</div></div></div>

