f="विदर्भ">vidarbha</a>. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="उग्रसेन">ugrasena</a> married her. After <a class="pe_a_pada" href="मर्रिअगे">marriage</a> she went and stayed once in her father's house for a short period. During that time through illegal intimacy with a messenger from <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कुबेर">kubera</a> named Gobhila she became pregnant. She started to destroy the foetus when from inside a voice said “I am being born to wreak vengeance on Mahāviṣṇu for killing <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कालनेमि">kālanemi</a>.” The son born thus was <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कंस">kaṁsa</a>. (Sṛṣṭikhaṇḍa, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पद्म">padma</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुराण">purāṇa</a>).</div></div></div>

