f the parts of five sages. It was called <a class="pe_a_pada" href="तप">tapa</a> also. (Chapter 220, Vana Parva).</div></div></div>

पञ्चक|పఞ్చక|ಪಞ್ಚಕ|pañcaka|pa~nchaka|_pe_@4963|_pe_pn548R
