ass="pe_a_pada" href="देव">deva</a> named <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पूषा">pūṣā</a>. The name of the other pārṣada was <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कालिक">kālika</a>. (Śloka 43, Chapter 45, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="शल्य">śalya</a> Parva)</div></div></div>

