r was <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अमृता">amṛtā</a>. This <a class="pe_a_pada" href="परीक्षित्">parīkṣit</a> begot of his wife <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सुयशा">suyaśā</a> a son named Bhīmasena. (Śloka 41, Chapter 95, Ādi Parva).</div></div></div>

