pe_a_pada" href="नृचक्षुस्">nṛcakṣus</a> and the grandson of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="नल">nala</a>. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पारिप्लव">pāriplava</a> got a son named <a class="pe_a_pada" href="मेधावी">medhāvī</a>. (10th <a class="pe_a_pada" href="स्कन्ध">skandha</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भागवत">bhāgavata</a>).</div></div></div>

