If anyone visits this holy place he would get the benefit of conducting an <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अग्निष्टोम">agniṣṭoma</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="यज्ञ">yajña</a> and an <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अतिरात्र">atirātra</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="यज्ञ">yajña</a>. (Śloka 12, Chapter 83, Vana Parva).</div></div></div>

