_pada" href="पर्णाद">parṇāda</a> who was sent out to know whether <a class="pe_a_pada" href="नल">nala</a> was alive and he found out <a class="pe_a_pada" href="नल">nala</a> living in disguise under the name of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="बाहुक">bāhuka</a> and after collecting all information about him returned to <a class="pe_a_pada" href="विदर्भ">vidarbha</a>. (See under <a class="pe_a_pada" href="दमयन्ती">damayantī</a>).</div></div></div>

पर्णाद_३|पर्णाद|పర్ణాద_౩|పర్ణాద|ಪರ್ಣಾದ_೩|ಪರ್ಣಾದ|parṇāda_3|parṇāda|parNaada_3|parNaada|_pe_@5064|_pe_pn574R
