/a>). (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="विश्वदेवस्">viśvadevas</a> are a particular group of deities, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="तेन्">ten</a> in number, supposed to be the sons of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="विश्वा">viśvā</a>).</div></div></div>

