nt was burnt to <a class="pe_a_pada" href="देअथ्">death</a> at the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सर्पसत्र">sarpasatra</a> of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="जनमेजय">janamejaya</a>. (Chapter 57, Ādi Parva).</div></div></div>

