ttle this demon fought against <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पनस">panasa</a> a <a class="pe_a_pada" href="मोन्केय्">monkey</a> warrior on the side of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="राम">rāma</a>. (Chapter 285, Vana Parva).</div></div></div>

