e_a_pada" href="कौरवस्">kauravas</a> joining the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="क्रौञ्चव्यूह">krauñcavyūha</a> constructed by <a class="pe_a_pada" href="धर्मपुत्र">dharmaputra</a> in the great battle. (Chapter 50, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भीष्म पर्व">bhīṣma parva</a>).</div></div></div>

