">yudhiṣṭhira</a> begot a son named <a class="pe_a_pada" href="देवक">devaka</a> of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पौरवी">pauravī</a>. (9th <a class="pe_a_pada" href="स्कन्ध">skandha</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भागवत">bhāgavata</a>).</div></div></div>

