ountain</a> is situated near Meru. (8th <a class="pe_a_pada" href="स्कन्ध">skandha</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="देवी">devī</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भागवत">bhāgavata</a>).</div></div></div>

