or a long time extending to thousands of years. From then onwards this became a holy place. (Chapter 83, Vana Parva, Śloka 86).</div></div></div>

फलौदक|ఫలౌదక|ಫಲೌದಕ|phalaudaka|_pe_@5163|_pe_pn588L
