who bathes in a holy river there would get immense gold. The place is worshipped by the sages. He who stays there for one day bathing in that river would get the benefit of conducting an Agniṣṭomayajña. (Chapter 82, Śloka 62, Vana Parva; Śloka 21, Chapter 88, Vana Parva; Śloka 57, Chapter 25, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अनुशासन पर्व">anuśāsana parva</a>).</div></div></div>

