ard to <a class="pe_a_pada" href="शिव">śiva</a> who spends his time in cremation grounds. This <a class="pe_a_pada" href="यक्ष">yakṣa</a> gives happiness to all in the world. (Śloka 51, Chapter 23, Vana Parva).</div></div></div>

