forest he met a forester. The latter got afraid and climbed up a <a class="pe_a_pada" href="शमी त्रेए">śamī tree</a>. Then a branch broke and it fell on the head of Gaṇeśa sitting beneath that tree. It was an act of worship and because of that both the forester and the demon were elevated. (Gaṇeśa <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुराण">purāṇa</a>).</div></div></div>

