oka 37, Chapter 6, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भीष्म पर्व">bhīṣma parva</a>).</div></div></div>

पिप्पलाय|పిప్పలాయ|ಪಿಪ್ಪಲಾಯ|pippalāya|pippalaaya|_pe_@5200|_pe_pn590L
