f the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कौरवस्">kauravas</a> in the great battle of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कुरुक्षेत्र">kurukṣetra</a>. He showered arrows on <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अभिमन्यु">abhimanyu</a>. (Chapter 37, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="द्रोण पर्व">droṇa parva</a>).</div></div></div>

