नु">svarbhānu</a>. She was married to king <a class="pe_a_pada" href="आयुस्">āyus</a> and <a class="pe_a_pada" href="आयुस्">āyus</a> begot of her sons like <a class="pe_a_pada" href="नहुष">nahuṣa</a> and others (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="ब्रह्माण्ड">brahmāṇḍa</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुराण">purāṇa</a>. 3--6--26).</div></div></div>

