ss="pe_a_pada" href="जनमेजय">janamejaya</a>. (Śloka 7, Chapter 53, Ādi Parva).</div></div></div>

प्रमाथ_१|प्रमाथ|ప్రమాథ_౧|ప్రమాథ|ಪ್ರಮಾಥ_೧|ಪ್ರಮಾಥ|pramātha_1|pramātha|pramaatha_1|pramaatha|_pe_@5297|_pe_pn601L
