 class="pe_a_pada" href="नाभाग">nābhāga</a>. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="धृष्ट">dhṛṣṭa</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="शर्याति">śaryāti</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="नरिष्यन्त">nariṣyanta</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="प्रांशुनृग">prāṁśunṛga</a>, Diṣṭa, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="करूष">karūṣa</a> and <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पृषध्र">pṛṣadhra</a> are all Manus. (7th <a class="pe_a_pada" href="स्कन्ध">skandha</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="देवी">devī</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भागवत">bhāgavata</a>)</div></div></div>

