/a> of his wife <a class="pe_a_pada" href="मनोहरा">manoharā</a>. This <a class="pe_a_pada" href="प्राण">prāṇa</a> was the younger brother of Varccas. These brothers had two other brothers named <a class="pe_a_pada" href="शिशिर">śiśira</a> and <a class="pe_a_pada" href="रमण">ramaṇa</a>. (Śloka 26, Chapter 66, Ādi Parva).</div></div></div>

प्राण_३|प्राण|ప్రాణ_౩|ప్రాణ|ಪ್ರಾಣ_೩|ಪ್ರಾಣ|prāṇa_3|prāṇa|praaNa_3|praaNa|_pe_@5319|_pe_pn602R
