ुप">kṣupa</a> is the son of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="प्रसन्धि">prasandhi</a>. (Śloka 2, Chapter 4, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अश्वमेध">aśvamedha</a> Parva).</div></div></div>

