ss="pe_a_pada" href="प्रहुत">prahuta</a>, Brāhmyahuta and <a class="pe_a_pada" href="प्राशित">prāśita</a>. (Śloka 73, Chapter 3, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="मनुस्मृति">manusmṛti</a>).</div></div></div>

प्रस्कण्व|ప్రస్కణ్వ|ಪ್ರಸ್ಕಣ್ವ|praskaṇva|praskaNva|_pe_@5344|_pe_pn604L
