ass="pe_a_pada" href="प्रस्कण्व">praskaṇva</a> line were Kṣatriyas formerly but they became brahmins later. (9th <a class="pe_a_pada" href="स्कन्ध">skandha</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भागवत">bhāgavata</a>).</div></div></div>

