 <a class="pe_a_pada" href="जयद्रथ">jayadratha</a> holding his flag. Arjunaslew him. (Śloka 10, Chapter 265, Vana Parva).</div></div></div>

प्रतापमुकुट|ప్రతాపముకుట|ಪ್ರತಾಪಮುಕುಟ|pratāpamukuṭa|prataapamukuTa|_pe_@5354|_pe_pn604R
