प्रतीहार">pratīhāra</a> was the son of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="परमेष्ठी">parameṣṭhī</a> and the father of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="प्रतिहर्ता">pratihartā</a>. (Chapter 1, Aṃśa 2, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="विष्णु">viṣṇu</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुराण">purāṇa</a>).</div></div></div>

