_pada" href="सुवर्चला">suvarcalā</a>. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="प्रतिहर्ता">pratihartā</a> got two sons of his wife Stuti. (5th <a class="pe_a_pada" href="स्कन्ध">skandha</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भागवत">bhāgavata</a>).</div></div></div>

