ten in Prakrit language. The book is called ‘Setukāvya’ and ‘Rāvaṇavadha’ also.</div></div></div>

प्रवर्षण|ప్రవర్షణ|ಪ್ರವರ್ಷಣ|pravarṣaṇa|pravarShaNa|_pe_@5393|_pe_pn606L
