a> got a son named <a class="pe_a_pada" href="दत्तोलि">dattoli</a> of her husband <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुलस्त्य">pulastya</a>, That <a class="pe_a_pada" href="दत्तोलि">dattoli</a> was in his previous birth the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अगस्त्य">agastya</a> of Svāyambhuva <a class="pe_a_pada" href="मन्वन्तर">manvantara</a>. (Chapter 107, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अंश">aṁśa</a> 17, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="विष्णु">viṣṇu</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुराण">purāṇa</a>).</div></div></div>

