d after the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="मर्रिअगे">marriage</a> of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="द्रौपदी">draupadī</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कर्ण">karṇa</a> killed him. (Ādi Parva, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="महाभारत">mahābhārata</a>).</div></div></div>

