<a class="pe_a_pada" href="निषध">niṣadha</a> and father of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="क्षेमधन्वा">kṣemadhanvā</a>. (9th <a class="pe_a_pada" href="स्कन्ध">skandha</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भागवत">bhāgavata</a>).</div></div></div>

