ne who bathes in a sacred pond there would get the benefit of doing a Puṇḍarīkayajña. (Śloka 83, Chapter 83, Vana Parva).</div></div></div>

पुण्डरीका|పుణ్డరీకా|ಪುಣ್ಡರೀಕಾ|puṇḍarīkā|puNDariikaa|puNDareekaa|_pe_@5474|_pe_pn614R
