me was Kratustha. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="मणिभद्र">maṇibhadra</a> got thirteen sons of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुण्यजनी">puṇyajanī</a>. (Chapters 3 and 7, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="ब्रह्माण्ड">brahmāṇḍa</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुराण">purāṇa</a>).</div></div></div>

