daśī. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="युधिष्ठिर">yudhiṣṭhira</a> was born on the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पञ्चमी">pañcamī</a> day called <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पूर्णा">pūrṇā</a>. (Śloka 6, Chapter 122, Ādi Parva).</div></div></div>

