 was burnt to <a class="pe_a_pada" href="देअथ्">death</a> at the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सर्पसत्र">sarpasatra</a> of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="जनमेजय">janamejaya</a>. (Śloka 16, Chapter 57, Ādi Parva).</div></div></div>

पूर्णांगद|पूर्णाङ्गद|పూర్ణాంగద|పూర్ణాఙ్గద|ಪೂರ್ಣಾಂಗದ|ಪೂರ್ಣಾಙ್ಗದ|pūrṇāṅgada|puurNaaMgada|poorNaaMgada|puurNaangada|poorNaangada|_pe_@5509|_pe_pn619L
