inister that the lac-palace was constructed and set fire to in order to kill the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पाण्डवस्">pāṇḍavas</a>. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुरोचन">purocana</a> was also burnt to <a class="pe_a_pada" href="देअथ्">death</a> when the lac-palace was destroyed by fire. (See under Arakkilla).</div></div></div>

