āṇa</a>, born to him of his wife <a class="pe_a_pada" href="ऊर्ज्जस्वती">ūrjjasvatī</a>. (6th <a class="pe_a_pada" href="स्कन्ध">skandha</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भागवत">bhāgavata</a>).</div></div></div>

