a_pada" href="बभ्रुसेतु">babhrusetu</a>. He ruled over the country of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="गान्धार">gāndhāra</a>. (Chapter 270, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अग्नि">agni</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुराण">purāṇa</a>). </div></div></div>

