 wife <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुष्करिणी">puṣkariṇī</a>, six sons named <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सुहोत्र">suhotra</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="दिविरथ">diviratha</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सुहोता">suhotā</a>, Suhavis, Suyajus and Ṛcika. (Chapter 94, Ādi Parva).</div></div></div>

पुष्करिणी_३|पुष्करिणी|పుష్కరిణీ_౩|పుష్కరిణీ|ಪುಷ್ಕರಿಣೀ_೩|ಪುಷ್ಕರಿಣೀ|puṣkariṇī_3|puṣkariṇī|puShkariNii_3|puShkariNii|puShkariNee_3|puShkariNee|_pe_@5554|_pe_pn623L
