/a> six sons named <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अंग">aṅga</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सुमनस्">sumanas</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="ख्याति">khyāti</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="क्रतु">kratu</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अंगिरस्">aṅgiras</a> and <a class="pe_a_pada" href="गय">gaya</a>. (4th <a class="pe_a_pada" href="स्कन्ध">skandha</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भागवत">bhāgavata</a>).</div></div></div>

