 href="सुब्रह्मण्य">subrahmaṇya</a> by <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पार्वती">pārvatī</a>. The other two were Unmāda and <a class="pe_a_pada" href="शंकुकर्ण">śaṅkukarṇa</a>. (Śloka 51, Chapter 45, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="शल्य">śalya</a> Parva).</div></div></div>

