">subrahmaṇya</a>. (See under <a class="pe_a_pada" href="ग्रहपीडा">grahapīḍā</a>. (Chapter 23, Vana Parva).</div></div></div>

पूतिका|పూతికా|ಪೂತಿಕಾ|pūtikā|puutikaa|pootikaa|_pe_@5575|_pe_pn625L
