ss="pe_a_pada" href="पार्वती">pārvatī</a>. (For details see under <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पार्वती">pārvatī</a>).</div></div></div>

रहस्यवेद|రహస్యవేద|ರಹಸ್ಯವೇದ|rahasyaveda|_pe_@5591|_pe_pn626L
