rajāpati. This stork was known as <a class="pe_a_pada" href="नाडीजंघ">nāḍījaṅgha</a> also. (See under <a class="pe_a_pada" href="नाडीजंघ">nāḍījaṅgha</a>).</div></div></div>

राजधर्मानुशासन पर्व|రాజధర్మానుశాసన పర్వ|ರಾಜಧರ್ಮಾನುಶಾಸನ ಪರ್ವ|rājadharmānuśāsana parva|raajadharmaanushaasana parva|_pe_@5612|_pe_pn627R
