 class="pe_a_pada" href="देव">deva</a> in the war between <a class="pe_a_pada" href="हिरण्याक्ष">hiraṇyākṣa</a> and the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="देवस्">devas</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="पद्म">padma</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुराण">purāṇa</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सृष्टि">sṛṣṭi</a> Khaṇḍa).</div></div></div>

