f="रावण">rāvaṇa</a> against <a class="pe_a_pada" href="राम">rāma</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="वाल्मीकि">vālmīki</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="रामायण">rāmāyaṇa</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सुन्दर">sundara</a> Kāṇḍa; <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सर्ग">sarga</a> 9). </div></div></div>

