dhic horse of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="राम">rāma</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="पद्म">padma</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुराण">purāṇa</a>, Pātālakhaṇḍa).</div></div></div>

