="pe_a_pada" href="आदित्य">āditya</a> called <a class="pe_a_pada" href="धाता">dhātā</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="भागवत">bhāgavata</a> 12th <a class="pe_a_pada" href="स्कन्ध">skandha</a>).</div></div></div>

