ुष्यन्त">duṣyanta</a>. She was the daughter of King <a class="pe_a_pada" href="ईलिन">īlina</a> and had five sons, i.e. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="दुष्यन्त">duṣyanta</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="शूर">śūra</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भीम">bhīma</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="प्रवसु">pravasu</a> and <a class="pe_a_pada" href="वसु">vasu</a>. (Ādi Parva, Chapter 94).</div></div></div>

