as</a>. His horses were very magnificent ones. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="द्रोण पर्व">droṇa parva</a>, Chapter 23, Verse 62).</div></div></div>

रथस्थ|రథస్థ|ರಥಸ್ಥ|rathastha|_pe_@5692|_pe_pn644L
