us deed of feeding brahmins she attained <a class="pe_a_pada" href="वैकुण्ठ">vaikuṇṭha</a> after her <a class="pe_a_pada" href="देअथ्">death</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="पद्म">padma</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुराण">purāṇa</a>, Kriyākhaṇḍa).</div></div></div>

