e performed tapas and attained <a class="pe_a_pada" href="वैकुण्ठ">vaikuṇṭha</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="पद्म">padma</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुराण">purāṇa</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पाताल">pātāla</a> Khaṇḍa).</div></div></div>

