a_pada" href="वैकुण्ठ">vaikuṇṭha</a> as a brahmin called Dharmāśva sprinkled <a class="pe_a_pada" href="गंगा">gaṅgā</a> water on him. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="पद्म">padma</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुराण">purāṇa</a>, Kriyākhaṇḍa).</div></div></div>

