ऋद्धिमान्|ఋద్ధిమాన్|ಋದ್ಧಿಮಾನ್|ṛddhimān|Rddhimaan|Riddhimaan|Ruddhimaan|RRiddhimaan|_pe_@5728|_pe_pn648R
