ṭra</a> family. In <a class="pe_a_pada" href="महाभारत">mahābhārata</a>, Ādi Parva, Chapter 57, Verse 11, we read that this <a class="pe_a_pada" href="नाग">nāga</a> was burnt to ashes at Janamejaya's <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सर्पसत्र">sarpasatra</a>. (Snake sacrifice).</div></div></div>

