्र">madra</a>. Mention is made in <a class="pe_a_pada" href="महाभारत">mahābhārata</a>, Ādi Parva, Chapter 185, Stanza 14, that this <a class="pe_a_pada" href="रुक्मांगद">rukmāṅgada</a>, the brother of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="रुक्मरथ">rukmaratha</a>, attended the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="स्वयंवर">svayaṁvara</a> (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="मर्रिअगे">marriage</a>) of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="द्रौपदी">draupadī</a>.</div></div></div>

रुक्मांगद_२|रुक्मांगद|रुक्माङ्गद_२|रुक्माङ्गद|రుక్మాంగద_౨|రుక్మాంగద|రుక్మాఙ్గద_౨|రుక్మాఙ్గద|ರುಕ್ಮಾಂಗದ_೨|ರುಕ್ಮಾಂಗದ|ರುಕ್ಮಾಙ್ಗದ_೨|ರುಕ್ಮಾಙ್ಗದ|rukmāṅgada_2|rukmāṅgada|rukmaaMgada_2|rukmaaMgada|rukmaangada_2|rukmaangada|_pe_@5832|_pe_pn656L
