ākṣa</a> and father of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कृशाश्व">kṛśāśva</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="भागवत">bhāgavata</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="स्कन्ध">skandha</a> 9). </div></div></div>

