ndana</a>) and father of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="जयत्सेन">jayatsena</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="भागवत">bhāgavata</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="स्कन्ध">skandha</a> 9).</div></div></div>

