_pada" href="पाण्डवस्">pāṇḍavas</a> lived incognito in the palace of King <a class="pe_a_pada" href="विराट">virāṭa</a>. (See under <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पाञ्चाली">pāñcālī</a>).</div></div></div>

