गिरिव्रज">girivraja</a>. The forest was near the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="आश्रम">āśrama</a> of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="गौतम">gautama</a>. (Sabhā Parva, Chapter 21, Verse 9).</div></div></div>

