world. (Vana Parva, Chapter 84, Verse 29).</div></div></div>

सकृद्ग्रह|సకృద్గ్రహ|ಸಕೃದ್ಗ್ರಹ|sakṛdgraha|sakRdgraha|sakRidgraha|sakRudgraha|sakRRidgraha|_pe_@5968|_pe_pn668L
