ant <a class="pe_a_pada" href="विद्युत्केश">vidyutkeśa</a> married this giantess <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सालकटंकटा">sālakaṭaṅkaṭā</a>. A son named <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सुकेश">sukeśa</a> was born to them. (See under <a class="pe_a_pada" href="विद्युत्केश">vidyutkeśa</a>).</div></div></div>

