 Mention is made in <a class="pe_a_pada" href="महाभारत">mahābhārata</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अनुशासन पर्व">anuśāsana parva</a>, Chapter 4, about this <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सालंकायन">sālaṅkāyana</a>.</div></div></div>

