="pe_a_pada" href="हस्तिनापुर">hastināpura</a> and had a talk with the lord. (M.B. Udyoga Pava, Southern Text, Chapter 83).</div></div></div>

शालिपिण्ड|శాలిపిణ్డ|ಶಾಲಿಪಿಣ್ಡ|śālipiṇḍa|shaalipiNDa|_pe_@6005|_pe_pn674L
