s="pe_a_pada" href="पाण्डवस्">pāṇḍavas</a> in the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भारत">bhārata</a> battle. (M.B. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="द्रोण पर्व">droṇa parva</a>, Chapter 158, Verse 42).</div></div></div>

