<a class="pe_a_pada" href="यज्ञ">yajña</a> performed by King <a class="pe_a_pada" href="गय">gaya</a>, son of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अमूर्तरयस्">amūrtarayas</a>. (Vana Parva, Chapter 95, Verse 17).</div></div></div>

