f <a class="pe_a_pada" href="हिरण्याक्ष">hiraṇyākṣa</a> and brother of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="शकुनि">śakuni</a>, Dvimūrdhā, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="शंकु">śaṅku</a> and Ārya. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="अग्नि">agni</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुराण">purāṇa</a>, Chapter 17). <a class="pe_a_pada" href="शम्बर">śambara</a>, who was a great adept in magic, was killed in the company of his wife <a class="pe_a_pada" href="मायावती">māyāvatī</a>, by <a class="pe_a_pada" href="प्रद्युम्न">pradyumna</a>, the son of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="श्री कृष्ण">śrī kṛṣṇa</a>. (See under <a class="pe_a_pada" href="प्रद्युम्न">pradyumna</a>).</div></div></div>

