 famed in the Purāṇas. According to <a class="pe_a_pada" href="महाभारत">mahābhārata</a> Mahāviṣṇu will incarnate as <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कल्कि">kalki</a> in this village. (For details see under <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कल्कि">kalki</a>).</div></div></div>

