brahmā</a>. The couple had a son called <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पौर्णमास">paurṇamāsa</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="अग्नि">agni</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुराण">purāṇa</a>, Chapter 20).</div></div></div>

