्ण">śrī kṛṣṇa</a> by his wife <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भद्रा">bhadrā</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="विराट">virāṭa</a> Parva, Chapter 54, Verse 18).</div></div></div>

संहन|సంహన|ಸಂಹನ|saṁhana|saMhana|_pe_@6067|_pe_pn679R
