रु">pūru</a> and son of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="मनस्यु">manasyu</a>. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="संहन">saṁhana</a> was the son of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="मनस्यु">manasyu</a> by his wife called <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सौवीरी">sauvīrī</a>. (Ādi Parva, Chapter 94, Verse 5).</div></div></div>

