ss="pe_a_pada" href="कौरव">kaurava</a> side. He took his place at the ‘hṛdaya’ (centre) of the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="गरुडव्यूह">garuḍavyūha</a> set up by <a class="pe_a_pada" href="द्रोण">droṇa</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="द्रोण पर्व">droṇa parva</a>, Chapter 20, Verse 12).</div></div></div>

