="विदुर">vidura</a> married her, and a son called Anaśva was born to the couple. (Ādi Parva, Chapter 95, Verse 40).</div></div></div>

सम्राज्|సమ్రాజ్|ಸಮ್ರಾಜ್|samrāj|samraaj|_pe_@6095|_pe_pn680R
