/a>. The couple had two sons called Sabhya and Āvasathya. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="मत्स्य">matsya</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुराण">purāṇa</a>, Chapter 51, Verse 12).</div></div></div>

