egion protected <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भीष्म">bhīṣma</a> during the great war. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="भीष्म पर्व">bhīṣma parva</a>, Chapter 51).</div></div></div>

सामुद्रकतीर्थ|సాముద్రకతీర్థ|ಸಾಮುದ್ರಕತೀರ್ಥ|sāmudrakatīrtha|saamudrakatiirtha|saamudrakateertha|_pe_@6103|_pe_pn681L
