ef="थ्रेए">three</a> days will derive the same benefits as those of performing the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अश्वमेध">aśvamedha</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="यज्ञ">yajña</a> and gifting away of thousand cows. (Vana Parva, Chapter 84, Verse 81).</div></div></div>

