śṛṅga</a>. He was killed by <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सुदेव">sudeva</a>, chief of the army of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अम्बरीष">ambarīṣa</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="महाभारत">mahābhārata</a>, Southern Text, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="शान्ति">śānti</a> Parva, Chapter 98). </div></div></div>

