very righteous, he studied Sāṅkhya and <a class="pe_a_pada" href="योग">yoga</a> from <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पञ्चशिख">pañcaśikha</a> and went into the forest renouncing everything. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="शान्ति">śānti</a> Parva, Chapter 1).</div></div></div>

