hing the distance between the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="मन्">man</a> and the spot where the thing thrown by him falls is called <a class="pe_a_pada" href="शम्यानिपात">śamyānipāta</a>. (Vana Parva, Chapter 84, Verse 9).</div></div></div>

