lass="pe_a_pada" href="व्यास">vyāsa</a> once built an <a class="pe_a_pada" href="आश्रम">āśrama</a> and lived there. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="देवी">devī</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भागवत">bhāgavata</a>, 6th <a class="pe_a_pada" href="स्कन्ध">skandha</a>).</div></div></div>

