href="यति">yati</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="ययाति">yayāti</a>, Āyāti and <a class="pe_a_pada" href="ध्रुव">dhruva</a>. (Ādi Parva, Chapter 75, Verse 30).</div></div></div>

