ेर">kubera</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="वाल्मीकि">vālmīki</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="रामायण">rāmāyaṇa</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="उत्तर">uttara</a> Kāṇḍa, Chapter 14, Verse 21).</div></div></div>

