da" href="वसिष्ठ">vasiṣṭha</a>. (For more details see under <a class="pe_a_pada" href="वसिष्ठ">vasiṣṭha</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पर">para</a> 1, Sub-Section 1).</div></div></div>

