a_pada" href="स्थूलकेश">sthūlakeśa</a> to see <a class="pe_a_pada" href="प्रमद्वरा">pramadvarā</a> who was lying there, bitten by a snake. (M.B. Ādi Parva, Chapter 8, Verse 24).</div></div></div>

