ho once taught him Sātvatadharma and Śaṁkhapada imparted the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="धर्म">dharma</a> to his son <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सुवर्णाभ">suvarṇābha</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="शान्ति">śānti</a> Parva, Chapter 348, Verse 37).</div></div></div>

