 dynasty. After giving his disciples lessons on impersonal (attributeless) God he went and lived in Devaloka. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="महाभारत">mahābhārata</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="शान्ति">śānti</a> Parva, Chapter 234, Verse 22).</div></div></div>

