a</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="शकुनि">śakuni</a>, Dvimūrdhā, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="शंकु">śaṅku</a> and Ārya were the sons of Hiraṇyāksa (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="अग्नि">agni</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुराण">purāṇa</a>, Chapter 19).</div></div></div>

