dhṛtarāṣṭra</a> dynasty. It was burnt to <a class="pe_a_pada" href="देअथ्">death</a> at the serpent <a class="pe_a_pada" href="यज्ञ">yajña</a> conducted by <a class="pe_a_pada" href="जनमेजय">janamejaya</a>. (Ādi Parva, Chapter 57, Verse 15).</div></div></div>

