lass="pe_a_pada" href="सुब्रह्मण्य">subrahmaṇya</a>, the other being <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुष्पदन्त">puṣpadanta</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="शल्य">śalya</a> Parva, Chapter 45, Verse 51).</div></div></div>

