>prasūti</a>. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="प्रसूति">prasūti</a> delivered including <a class="pe_a_pada" href="शान्ति">śānti</a> twentyfour children. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="विष्णु">viṣṇu</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुराण">purāṇa</a>, Part 1, Chapter 7).</div></div></div>

