" href="दुष्यन्त">duṣyanta</a>. He was the son of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="नील">nīla</a>, grandson of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अजमीढ">ajamīḍha</a> and father of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सुशान्ति">suśānti</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="भागवत">bhāgavata</a>, 9th <a class="pe_a_pada" href="स्कन्ध">skandha</a>).</div></div></div>

