nasty. It was burnt to <a class="pe_a_pada" href="देअथ्">death</a> at Janamejaya's serpent <a class="pe_a_pada" href="यज्ञ">yajña</a>. (Ādi Parva, Chapter 57, Verse 8).</div></div></div>

