purāṇa</a>, Svargakhaṇḍa, about another hermit <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सारस्वत">sārasvata</a>, who taught the Vedas to several disciples in <a class="pe_a_pada" href="तुंगकारण्य">tuṅgakāraṇya</a>.</div></div></div>

सारस्वत_५|सारस्वत|సారస్వత_౫|సారస్వత|ಸಾರಸ್ವತ_೫|ಸಾರಸ್ವತ|sārasvata_5|sārasvata|saarasvata_5|saarasvata|_pe_@6294|_pe_pn695L
