="रावण">rāvaṇa</a> about the arrival of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="राम">rāma</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="वाल्मीकि">vālmīki</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="रामायण">rāmāyaṇa</a>, Yuddhakāṇḍa, Canto 30).</div></div></div>

