numatī</a>, daughter of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कृतवीर्य">kṛtavīrya</a>. This <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सार्वभौम">sārvabhauma</a> married <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सुनन्दा">sunandā</a>, daughter of the King of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="केकय">kekaya</a>. (M.B. Ādi Parva, Chapter 95).</div></div></div>

