class="pe_a_pada" href="सावर्णि">sāvarṇi</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="मनु">manu</a>. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सार्वभौम">sārvabhauma</a> was begotten by Devaguhya and was born of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सरस्वती">sarasvatī</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="भागवत">bhāgavata</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="स्कन्ध">skandha</a> 8).</div></div></div>

