">paraśurāma</a> killed the Kṣatriyas it was Parāśaramuni, who saved <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सर्वकर्मा">sarvakarmā</a> from <a class="pe_a_pada" href="देअथ्">death</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="शान्ति">śānti</a> Parva, Chapter 49, Verse 76).</div></div></div>

