f="पुरञ्जय">purañjaya</a> was Śaśāda's son. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="ब्रह्माण्ड">brahmāṇḍa</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुराण">purāṇa</a>. Chapter 1).</div></div></div>

