>jāmbavatī</a>. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="शतजित्">śatajit</a> met with his <a class="pe_a_pada" href="देअथ्">death</a> in the quarrels among the Yādavas at Prabhāsatīrtha. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="भागवत">bhāgavata</a>, 9th <a class="pe_a_pada" href="स्कन्ध">skandha</a>).</div></div></div>

