er of Indumukhī, the wife of Sahasramukha <a class="pe_a_pada" href="रावण">rāvaṇa</a>. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="शतमुख">śatamukha</a> had defeated <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पाताल">pātāla</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="रावण">rāvaṇa</a> in battle. He gave the eternal weapon called Kaṭhorakuṭhāra as dowry for his daughter's wedding. (See under Sahasramukha <a class="pe_a_pada" href="रावण">rāvaṇa</a>).</div></div></div>

शतमुख_२|शतमुख|శతముఖ_౨|శతముఖ|ಶತಮುಖ_೨|ಶತಮುಖ|śatamukha_2|śatamukha|shatamukha_2|shatamukha|_pe_@6385|_pe_pn701L
