>śataśṛṅga</a>. It was this <a class="pe_a_pada" href="मुनि">muni</a>, who cursed <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पाण्डु">pāṇḍu</a> that he would die on his coming into physical contact with his wife. (For details see under <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पाण्डु">pāṇḍu</a> and <a class="pe_a_pada" href="महाभारत">mahābhārata</a>).</div></div></div>

