lass="pe_a_pada" href="कौरव">kaurava</a> side and got killed by <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अर्जुन">arjuna</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="द्रोण पर्व">droṇa parva</a>, Chapter 31 Verse 62).</div></div></div>

