da" href="ब्रह्माण्ड">brahmāṇḍa</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुराण">purāṇa</a>, Śloka 73, of a <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पाञ्चाल">pāñcāla</a> King <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सत्यकेतु">satyaketu</a> who fought with <a class="pe_a_pada" href="परशुराम">paraśurāma</a>.</div></div></div>

