ta</a> (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="त्रिशंकु">triśaṅku</a>) the king of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अयोध्या">ayodhyā</a> married this princess. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="वायु">vāyu</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुराण">purāṇa</a>, Chapter 88; Verse 117). </div></div></div>

