s="pe_a_pada" href="महाभारत">mahābhārata</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="शान्ति">śānti</a> Parva, Chapter 234, Verse 16, as to how, this king <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सत्यसन्ध">satyasandha</a>, who was an observer of vows and fasts, saved the life of a Brahmin by sacrificing his own life.</div></div></div>

