ref="त्रिगर्त">trigarta</a>. It is mentioned in <a class="pe_a_pada" href="महाभारत">mahābhārata</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कर्ण">karṇa</a> Parva, Chapter 27, Verse 3, that this <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सत्यसेन">satyasena</a> confronted <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अर्जुन">arjuna</a> in the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भारत">bhārata</a>-battle and was killed by him.</div></div></div>

सत्यसेन_३|सत्यसेन|సత్యసేన_౩|సత్యసేన|ಸತ್ಯಸೇನ_೩|ಸತ್ಯಸೇನ|satyasena_3|satyasena|_pe_@6472|_pe_pn708L
