 chariot of his father <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कर्ण">karṇa</a> in the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भारत">bhārata</a>-battle. (M.B. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कर्ण">karṇa</a> Parva, Chapter 48, Verse 18).</div></div></div>

