oenix tree. Later this hermit liberated her from the curse. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="पद्म">padma</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुराण">purāṇa</a>, Uttarakhaṇḍa, Chapter 178).</div></div></div>

