a class="pe_a_pada" href="त्रिशंकु">triśaṅku</a> and the mother of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="हरिश्चन्द्र">hariścandra</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="महाभारत">mahābhārata</a>, Dākṣiṇātyapāṭha, Sabhā Parva, Chapter 12).</div></div></div>

