ass="pe_a_pada" href="अनुशासन पर्व">anuśāsana parva</a>, Chapter 35, Verse 17, mentions that they were debased on account of a curse by a <a class="pe_a_pada" href="ब्राह्मण">brāhmaṇa</a>.</div></div></div>

