 in <a class="pe_a_pada" href="महाभारत">mahābhārata</a>, Udyoga Parva, Chapter 4, Verse 13 that the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पाण्डवस्">pāṇḍavas</a> had decided to send a letter of invitation to this King, for the battle of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भारत">bhārata</a>.</div></div></div>

सेनजित्_२|सेनजित्|సేనజిత్_౨|సేనజిత్|ಸೇನಜಿತ್_೨|ಸೇನಜಿತ್|senajit_2|senajit|_pe_@6558|_pe_pn714R
