"धृतराष्ट्र">dhṛtarāṣṭra</a>. He was killed by Bhīmasena in the battle of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भारत">bhārata</a>. (M.B. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भीष्म पर्व">bhīṣma parva</a>, Chapter 54, Verse 32).</div></div></div>

