>devas</a>. The group of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="देवस्">devas</a> called Siddhas lived on the Himālayas near the hermitage of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कण्व">kaṇva</a>. (M.B. Ādi Parva, Chapter 70, Verse 15). It is mentioned in <a class="pe_a_pada" href="महाभारत">mahābhārata</a>, Sabhā Parva, Chapter 8, Verse 29, that this group of Gods stay in the palace of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="यम">yama</a> serving him.</div></div></div>

