="वाल्मीकि">vālmīki</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="रामायण">rāmāyaṇa</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अयोध्या">ayodhyā</a> Kāṇḍa, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सर्ग">sarga</a> 36).</div></div></div>

