da" href="भारत">bhārata</a> he took the side of the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पाण्डवस्">pāṇḍavas</a> and was killed in the battle by <a class="pe_a_pada" href="द्रोण">droṇa</a>. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="द्रोण पर्व">droṇa parva</a>, Chapter 16, Verse 32).</div></div></div>

