कर्ण">karṇa</a> killed him in the battle of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भारत">bhārata</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="कर्ण">karṇa</a> Parva, Chapter 56, Verse 44).</div></div></div>

