<a class="pe_a_pada" href="मनोहरा">manoharā</a>. To the couple were born four sons called <a class="pe_a_pada" href="वर्चस्">varcas</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="प्राण">prāṇa</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="रमण">ramaṇa</a> and <a class="pe_a_pada" href="शिशिर">śiśira</a>. (Ādi Parva, Chapter 66, Verse 22).</div></div></div>

