then flew away in the form of a she-kite. (Vana Parva, Chapter 225).</div></div></div>

शिवा_२|शिवा|శివా_౨|శివా|ಶಿವಾ_೨|ಶಿವಾ|śivā_2|śivā|shivaa_2|shivaa|_pe_@6649|_pe_pn731L
