nd mother of two sons called <a class="pe_a_pada" href="मनोजव">manojava</a> and <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अविज्ञातगति">avijñātagati</a>. (Ādi Parva, Chapter 66, Verse 25).</div></div></div>

