_pada" href="इन्द्र">indra</a> once fled to this place in fear of the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="असुर">asura</a> called <a class="pe_a_pada" href="शूरपद्म">śūrapadma</a> and did tapas there. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="स्कन्द">skanda</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुराण">purāṇa</a>).</div></div></div>

