his would enter the womb of pregnant women and afflict the child in the womb. (M.B. Vana Parva, Chapter 230, Verse 26).</div></div></div>

स्कन्ध|స్కన్ధ|ಸ್ಕನ್ಧ|skandha|_pe_@6665|_pe_pn733L
