तराष्ट्र">dhṛtarāṣṭra</a>. This serpent was burnt to <a class="pe_a_pada" href="देअथ्">death</a> in the sacrificial fire of the serpent sacrifice of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="जनमेजय">janamejaya</a>. (M.B. Ādi Parva, Chapter 57, Verse 18).</div></div></div>

