>. It is mentioned in <a class="pe_a_pada" href="महाभारत">mahābhārata</a>, Sabhā Parva, Chapter 11, Verse 49, that this god dwells in the palace of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="ब्रह्मा">brahmā</a>.</div></div></div>

सोमपद|సోమపద|ಸೋಮಪದ|somapada|_pe_@6692|_pe_pn734L
