"pe_a_pada" href="श्राद्ध">śrāddha</a> is a very important ceremony. Here, “Pitṛs” does not mean “the souls of the dead”. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पितृस्">pitṛs</a> belong to a special class of gods.</div></div></div>

