pada" href="मोउन्तैन्">mountain</a> and offer worship to <a class="pe_a_pada" href="शंकर">śaṅkara</a> after bathing in the forest rivers get the same reward as from an Aśvamedhayāga. (M.B. Vana Parva, Chapter 85, Verse 18).</div></div></div>

