श्री रामकृष्ण परमहंस|శ్రీ రామకృష్ణ పరమహంస|ಶ್ರೀ ರಾಮಕೃಷ್ಣ ಪರಮಹಂಸ|śrī rāmakṛṣṇa paramahaṁsa|shrii raamakRShNa paramahaMsa|shree raamakRShNa paramahaMsa|shrii raamakRiShNa paramahaMsa|shrii raamakRuShNa paramahaMsa|shrii raamakRRiShNa paramahaMsa|_pe_@6741|_pe_pn737R
