hter of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कश्यप">kaśyapa</a> gave birth to Ṛkṣas (Bears) Sṛmaras (young <a class="pe_a_pada" href="देएर्">deer</a>) and Camaras (a kind of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="देएर्">deer</a> called Bos grunniens). (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="वाल्मीकि">vālmīki</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="रामायण">rāmāyaṇa</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अरण्य">araṇya</a> Kāṇḍa, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सर्ग">sarga</a> 14).</div></div></div>

