netra</a> and father of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="दृढसेन">dṛḍhasena</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="भागवत">bhāgavata</a>, 9th <a class="pe_a_pada" href="स्कन्ध">skandha</a>).</div></div></div>

