वत">bhāgavata</a>, 10th <a class="pe_a_pada" href="स्कन्ध">skandha</a> it is stated that once he had described the story of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="श्री कृष्ण">śrī kṛṣṇa</a>. </div></div></div>

