The eleven Rudras were born from <a class="pe_a_pada" href="स्थाणु">sthāṇu</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="महाभारत">mahābhārata</a>, Ādi Parva, Chapter 66).</div></div></div>

स्थाणु_२|स्थाणु|స్థాణు_౨|స్థాణు|ಸ್ಥಾಣು_೨|ಸ್ಥಾಣು|sthāṇu_2|sthāṇu|sthaaNu_2|sthaaNu|_pe_@6805|_pe_pn743R
