with this giant and <a class="pe_a_pada" href="वैश्रवण">vaiśravaṇa</a> cursed his servant. (See under <a class="pe_a_pada" href="गुणाढ्य">guṇāḍhya</a>).</div></div></div>

स्थूलवालुका|స్థూలవాలుకా|ಸ್ಥೂಲವಾಲುಕಾ|sthūlavālukā|sthuulavaalukaa|sthoolavaalukaa|_pe_@6815|_pe_pn744L
