apsarā had participated in the birthday celebrations of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अर्जुन">arjuna</a>. (Ādi Parva, Chapter 122, Verse 63).</div></div></div>

सुबाहु_३|सुबाहु|సుబాహు_౩|సుబాహు|ಸುಬಾಹು_೩|ಸುಬಾಹು|subāhu_3|subāhu|subaahu_3|subaahu|_pe_@6826|_pe_pn744R
