"हर">hara</a> the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="असुर">asura</a> reborn as such. The <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पाण्डवस्">pāṇḍavas</a>, thought of despatching a letter inviting this King to the great war. (Udyoga Parva, Chapter 4, Verse 14).</div></div></div>

