 Both his hands were cut off in his fight with <a class="pe_a_pada" href="युयुत्सु">yuyutsu</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="द्रोण पर्व">droṇa parva</a>, Chapter 25, Verse 13).</div></div></div>

