a parva</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="महाभारत">mahābhārata</a>, about a <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सुबाहु">subāhu</a>, who never consumed flesh in life.</div></div></div>

सुबाहु_१३|सुबाहु|సుబాహు_౧౩|సుబాహు|ಸುಬಾಹು_೧೩|ಸುಬಾಹು|subāhu_13|subāhu|subaahu_13|subaahu|_pe_@6836|_pe_pn745L
