 King <a class="pe_a_pada" href="जयद्रथ">jayadratha</a>. (Vana Parva, Chapter 265, Verse 8).</div></div></div>

सुबल_३|सुबल|సుబల_౩|సుబల|ಸುಬಲ_೩|ಸುಬಲ|subala_3|subala|_pe_@6840|_pe_pn745R
