्मृति">manusmṛti</a> (Chapter 2, 129) one should use this word when one addresses the wives of others and women who are not one's relatives.<span class="NIvirupu"><br><br></span>Parapatnī tu yā <a class="pe_a_pada" href="स्त्री">strī</a> syādasambandhā ca yonitaḥ /<span class="NIvirupu"><br><br></span>Tām brūyād bhavatītyevaṁ subhage bhaginīti ca //</div></div></div>

