śvaphalka</a>, son of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पृश्नि">pṛśni</a>. She was Akrūra's sister. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="भागवत">bhāgavata</a>, 9th <a class="pe_a_pada" href="स्कन्ध">skandha</a>). </div></div></div>

