="pe_a_pada" href="सूर्य">sūrya</a>, the other one being <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भास्वर">bhāsvara</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="शल्य">śalya</a> Parva, Chapter 45, Verse 31).</div></div></div>

