hārata</a>, Ādi Parva, Chapter 66, Verse 46). This <a class="pe_a_pada" href="गन्धर्व">gandharva</a> was the son of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="प्रजापति">prajāpati</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कश्यप">kaśyapa</a>, by his wife Pradhā. This <a class="pe_a_pada" href="गन्धर्व">gandharva</a> participated in the birth celebration of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अर्जुन">arjuna</a>. (M.B. Ādi Parva, Chapter 122, Verse 58).</div></div></div>

