rence to a King <a class="pe_a_pada" href="शुचि">śuci</a> who worships <a class="pe_a_pada" href="यम">yama</a>, the son of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सूर्य">sūrya</a>, in Yama's assembly.</div></div></div>

