"pe_a_pada" href="वसिष्ठ">vasiṣṭha</a>, this Maharṣi was born as a mortal, as the son of King <a class="pe_a_pada" href="विजिताश्व">vijitāśva</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="भागवत">bhāgavata</a>, 4th <a class="pe_a_pada" href="स्कन्ध">skandha</a>).</div></div></div>

