" href="अभिमन्यु">abhimanyu</a> in the battle of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भारत">bhārata</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="महाभारत">mahābhārata</a>, Bhīsma Parva, Chapter 79, Verse 22).</div></div></div>

