good fighter from chariot. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="महाभारत">mahābhārata</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कर्ण">karṇa</a> Parva, Chapter 6, Stanza 27). While this king and his son <a class="pe_a_pada" href="चित्रवर्मा">citravarmā</a> were walking in the battlefield, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="द्रोण">droṇa</a> killed them.</div></div></div>

