"भीम">bhīma</a>, the king of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="विदर्भ">vidarbha</a>, and the other by <a class="pe_a_pada" href="वीरबाहु">vīrabāhu</a> king of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="चेदि">cedi</a>. (M.B. Vana Parva, Chapter 96, Verse 14).</div></div></div>

