ref="असुर">asura</a>, because of the curse of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="देवी">devī</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="राधा">rādhā</a>. (For further details see under <a class="pe_a_pada" href="तुलसी">tulasī</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पर">para</a> 5).</div></div></div>

