e_a_pada" href="भागवत">bhāgavata</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="स्कन्ध">skandha</a> 10, that this <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सुदामा">sudāmā</a> adorned <a class="pe_a_pada" href="श्री कृष्ण">śrī kṛṣṇa</a> and <a class="pe_a_pada" href="बलभद्र">balabhadra</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="राम">rāma</a> with flower garlands.</div></div></div>

