pe_a_pada" href="भारत">bhārata</a>, Vana Parva, Chapter 83, Verse 100, that by bathing in this holy <a class="pe_a_pada" href="तीर्थ">tīrtha</a> one could attain the world of the Sun.</div></div></div>

