>pāṇḍavas</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="महाभारत">mahābhārata</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भीष्म पर्व">bhīṣma parva</a>, Chapter 25, Verse 16).</div></div></div>

