class="pe_a_pada" href="भरत">bharata</a> and son of Bhumanyu. His mother was called <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुष्करिणी">puṣkariṇī</a>. (Ādi Parva, Chapter 94, Verse 24).</div></div></div>

सुह्म_१|सुह्म|సుహ్మ_౧|సుహ్మ|ಸುಹ್ಮ_೧|ಸುಹ್ಮ|suhma_1|suhma|_pe_@6987|_pe_pn756R
