y of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="शिबि">śibi</a>, born in the family of  King <a class="pe_a_pada" href="उशीनर">uśīnara</a>. He let <a class="pe_a_pada" href="शिबि">śibi</a> go only after the intervention of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="नारद">nārada</a>. (See under <a class="pe_a_pada" href="शिबि">śibi</a>).</div></div></div>

