class="pe_a_pada" href="हस्तिनापुर">hastināpura</a> and conversed with him. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="महाभारत">mahābhārata</a>, Dākṣiṇātyapāṭha, Udyoga Parva, Chapter 83).</div></div></div>

