n born to <a class="pe_a_pada" href="मणिवर">maṇivara</a> by Devajanī. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="ब्रह्माण्ड">brahmāṇḍa</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुराण">purāṇa</a>, 3. 7. 129).</div></div></div>

