a</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="वाल्मीकि">vālmīki</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="रामायण">rāmāyaṇa</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सुन्दर">sundara</a> Kāṇḍa, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सर्ग">sarga</a> 6).</div></div></div>

