a" href="शूकर">śūkara</a> had presented thousands of Elephants at Yudhiṣthira's <a class="pe_a_pada" href="राजसूय">rājasūya</a> yāga. (M.B. Sabhā Parva, Chapter 52, Verse 25).</div></div></div>

