ass="pe_a_pada" href="विधाता">vidhātā</a>. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सुव्रत">suvrata</a> was the other follower. (M.B. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="शल्य">śalya</a> Parva, Chapter 45, Verse 42).</div></div></div>

