a_pada" href="सुकर्मा">sukarmā</a>, the son of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सुत्वा">sutvā</a>, divided the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सामवेद">sāmaveda</a> into a thousand branches. (See under <a class="pe_a_pada" href="गुरुपरम्परा">guruparamparā</a>.)</div></div></div>

