"सुकुमारी">sukumārī</a> was a wife of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="नारद">nārada</a>. (See under <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पर्वत">parvata</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पर">para</a> 2).</div></div></div>

