pada" href="माली">mālī</a>. When <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अगस्त्य">agastya</a> cursed and transformed <a class="pe_a_pada" href="ताटका">tāṭakā</a> and her sons into Rākṣasas it was <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सुमाली">sumālī</a> who <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुत्">put</a> them up in <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पाताल">pātāla</a> and <a class="pe_a_pada" href="लंका">laṅkā</a>. (See under <a class="pe_a_pada" href="माली">mālī</a>).</div></div></div>

