arva, Chapter 9, Verse 13).</div></div></div>

सुमति_२|सुमति|సుమతి_౨|సుమతి|ಸುಮತಿ_೨|ಸುಮತಿ|sumati_2|sumati|_pe_@7088|_pe_pn763R
