his bed of arrows. (Anuśāsana Parva, Chapter 26, Verse 4).</div></div></div>

सुमति_३|सुमति|సుమతి_౩|సుమతి|ಸುಮತಿ_೩|ಸುಮತಿ|sumati_3|sumati|_pe_@7089|_pe_pn763R
