 class="pe_a_pada" href="थ्रेए">three</a> sons called <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सुमीढ">sumīḍha</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अजमीढ">ajamīḍha</a> and <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुरुमीढ">purumīḍha</a>. (Ādi Parva, Chapter 94, Verse 30).</div></div></div>

