i</a> and brother of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="युधाजित्">yudhājit</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="भागवत">bhāgavata</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="स्कन्ध">skandha</a> 10).</div></div></div>

