e_a_pada" href="क्रोधवश">krodhavaśa</a>, the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="असुर">asura</a> reborn as King. (Ādi Parva, Chapter 67, Verse 63). He was a partisan of the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पाण्डवस्">pāṇḍavas</a> and a member in Yudhiṣṭhira's court. (Sabhā Parva, Chapter 4, Verse 25). </div></div></div>

