">jāmbavatī</a>. In the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="यादव">yādava</a> war he met with <a class="pe_a_pada" href="देअथ्">death</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="भागवत">bhāgavata</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="स्कन्ध">skandha</a> 10).</div></div></div>

