" href="धृतराष्ट्र">dhṛtarāṣṭra</a>. He was killed in the great war by <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भीम">bhīma</a>. (M.B. Southern Text, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भीष्म पर्व">bhīṣma parva</a>, Chapter 88; Ādi Parva, Chapter 116).</div></div></div>

सुनाभ_२|सुनाभ|సునాభ_౨|సునాభ|ಸುನಾಭ_೨|ಸುನಾಭ|sunābha_2|sunābha|sunaabha_2|sunaabha|_pe_@7117|_pe_pn764L
