्कर">puṣkara</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="तीर्थ">tīrtha</a> with children and grandchildren in the worship of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="वरुण">varuṇa</a>. (M.B. Sabhā Parva, Chapter 9, Verse 28).</div></div></div>

सुनाभ_३|सुनाभ|సునాభ_౩|సునాభ|ಸುನಾಭ_೩|ಸುನಾಭ|sunābha_3|sunābha|sunaabha_3|sunaabha|_pe_@7118|_pe_pn764L
