anābha</a>. His  daughters, Candravatī and <a class="pe_a_pada" href="गुणवती">guṇavatī</a> were abducted by <a class="pe_a_pada" href="गद">gada</a> and <a class="pe_a_pada" href="साम्ब">sāmba</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="हरिवंश">harivaṁśa</a>).</div></div></div>

सुनाभ_४|सुनाभ|సునాభ_౪|సునాభ|ಸುನಾಭ_೪|ಸುನಾಭ|sunābha_4|sunābha|sunaabha_4|sunaabha|_pe_@7119|_pe_pn764R
