 class="pe_a_pada" href="कुबेर">kubera</a>. (Sabhā Parva, Chapter 10, Verse 32).</div></div></div>

शुनक_१|शुनक|శునక_౧|శునక|ಶುನಕ_೧|ಶುನಕ|śunaka_1|śunaka|shunaka_1|shunaka|_pe_@7120|_pe_pn764R
