a" href="भागवत">bhāgavata</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="स्कन्ध">skandha</a> 9, that he was the son of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="निरमित्र">niramitra</a> and the father of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="बृहत्सेन">bṛhatsena</a>.</div></div></div>

