कंस">kaṁsa</a>. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सुनामा">sunāmā</a> was killed by <a class="pe_a_pada" href="श्री कृष्ण">śrī kṛṣṇa</a> and <a class="pe_a_pada" href="बलभद्रराम">balabhadrarāma</a>. (Sabhā Parva, Chapter 14, Verse 34).</div></div></div>

