जापति">prajāpati</a> by his wife <a class="pe_a_pada" href="मुनि">muni</a>. (Ādi Parva, Chapter 65, Verse 42).</div></div></div>

सुपर्ण_२|सुपर्ण|సుపర్ణ_౨|సుపర్ణ|ಸುಪರ್ಣ_೨|ಸುಪರ್ಣ|suparṇa_2|suparṇa|suparNa_2|suparNa|_pe_@7165|_pe_pn766L
