="मयूर">mayūra</a>. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सुपर्ण">suparṇa</a> in after life was born as King <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कालकीर्ति">kālakīrti</a> on earth. (Ādi Parva, Chapter 67, Verse 36).</div></div></div>

सुपर्ण_४|सुपर्ण|సుపర్ణ_౪|సుపర్ణ|ಸುಪರ್ಣ_೪|ಸುಪರ್ಣ|suparṇa_4|suparṇa|suparNa_4|suparNa|_pe_@7167|_pe_pn766L
