 aged and weak <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सम्पाति">sampāti</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="वाल्मीकि">vālmīki</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="रामायण">rāmāyaṇa</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="किष्किन्धा">kiṣkindhā</a> Kāṇḍa, Canto 59, Verse 8).</div></div></div>

