">put</a> her up in the mansion named <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पद्मकूट">padmakūṭa</a> at <a class="pe_a_pada" href="द्वारका">dvārakā</a>. (M.B. Southern Text, Chapter 38).</div></div></div>

