 <a class="pe_a_pada" href="जया">jayā</a> and <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सुप्रभा">suprabhā</a>, daughters of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="दक्ष">dakṣa</a>. (For details see under <a class="pe_a_pada" href="जया">jayā</a> V).</div></div></div>

