e_a_pada" href="सुप्रतीक">supratīka</a> were born the elephants <a class="pe_a_pada" href="ऐरावत">airāvata</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="वामन">vāmana</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कुमुद">kumuda</a> and <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अञ्जन">añjana</a>. (Udyoga Parva, Chapter 99).</div></div></div>

