s considered to be the source of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अग्नि">agni</a> (fire). (Vana Parva, Chapter 222, Verse 25).</div></div></div>

सुप्रिया|సుప్రియా|ಸುಪ್ರಿಯಾ|supriyā|supriyaa|_pe_@7197|_pe_pn766R
