f <a class="pe_a_pada" href="दक्ष">dakṣa</a>. (Ādi Parva Chapter 65, Verse 51). <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सुप्रिया">supriyā</a> participated in the birthday celebrations of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अर्जुन">arjuna</a>. (Ādi Parva, Chapter 122, Verse 63).</div></div></div>

