" href="राक्षस">rākṣasa</a>, by his wife <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सुन्दरी">sundarī</a>. (See under <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सुन्दरी">sundarī</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="माल्यवान्">mālyavān</a> and <a class="pe_a_pada" href="माली">mālī</a>). </div></div></div>

सुपुञ्जिक|సుపుఞ్జిక|ಸುಪುಞ್ಜಿಕ|supuñjika|supu~njika|_pe_@7199|_pe_pn767L
