">siṁhikā</a>. He was killed by <a class="pe_a_pada" href="परशुराम">paraśurāma</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="ब्रह्माण्ड">brahmāṇḍa</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुराण">purāṇa</a>, 3.6. 13-12).</div></div></div>

