ref="भीष्म पर्व">bhīṣma parva</a>, Chapter 221, Verse 9).</div></div></div>

शूर_१|शूर|శూర_౧|శూర|ಶೂರ_೧|ಶೂರ|śūra_1|śūra|shuura_1|shuura|shoora_1|shoora|_pe_@7201|_pe_pn767L
