akāmeṣṭi Yāga performed by <a class="pe_a_pada" href="दशरथ">daśaratha</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="वाल्मीकि">vālmīki</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="रामायण">rāmāyaṇa</a>, Bāla Kāṇḍa, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सर्ग">sarga</a> 13, Verse 26).</div></div></div>

