ापति">prajāpati</a> by his wife Pradhā. (Ādi Parva, Chapter 65, Verse 50). <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सुरजा">surajā</a> gave a dance performance at the birthday celebrations of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अर्जुन">arjuna</a>. (Ādi Parva, Chapter 122, Verse 63).</div></div></div>

