nvaded Devaloka with a huge army. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="स्कन्द">skanda</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुराण">purāṇa</a> mentions that in the battle that followed, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="इन्द्र">indra</a>, who was defeated, fled to the place called <a class="pe_a_pada" href="शियालि">śiyāli</a> in Tanjore District in South <a class="pe_a_pada" href="इन्दिअ">india</a> and did tapas to <a class="pe_a_pada" href="शिव">śiva</a>.</div></div></div>

