r. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="द्रोण पर्व">droṇa parva</a>, Chapter 18, Verse 20).</div></div></div>

सुरथ_९|सुरथ|సురథ_౯|సురథ|ಸುರಥ_೯|ಸುರಥ|suratha_9|suratha|_pe_@7241|_pe_pn768R
