"अश्वत्थामा">aśvatthāmā</a> in the great war. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="द्रोण पर्व">droṇa parva</a>, Chapter 156, Verse 180).</div></div></div>

सुरथ_१०|सुरथ|సురథ_౧౦|సురథ|ಸುರಥ_೧೦|ಸುರಥ|suratha_10|suratha|_pe_@7242|_pe_pn768R
