_pada" href="ऋषभ">ṛṣabha</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="इस्लन्द्">island</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="शल्य">śalya</a> Parva, Chapter 38, Verse 26)</div></div></div>

