e_a_pada" href="स्वयंवर">svayaṁvara</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="मर्रिअगे">marriage</a> of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="द्रौपदी">draupadī</a>. (M.B. Ādi Parva, Chapter 185, Stanza 10).</div></div></div>

