त्र">gotra</a>. He participated in the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="राजसूय">rājasūya</a> conducted by <a class="pe_a_pada" href="युधिष्ठिर">yudhiṣṭhira</a>. (Sabhā Parva, Chapter 33, Verse 34).</div></div></div>

