t once <a class="pe_a_pada" href="इन्द्र">indra</a> bound the magician <a class="pe_a_pada" href="शुष्ण">śuṣṇa</a> in chains and <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुत्">put</a> him in prison.</div></div></div>

