>parīkṣit</a> of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="इक्ष्वाकु">ikṣvāku</a> dynasty married her and <a class="pe_a_pada" href="थ्रेए">three</a> sons <a class="pe_a_pada" href="शल">śala</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="दल">dala</a> and <a class="pe_a_pada" href="बल">bala</a>, were born to the couple. (See under Parkīṣit II).</div></div></div>

सुश्रवस्_१|सुश्रवस्|సుశ్రవస్_౧|సుశ్రవస్|ಸುಶ್ರವಸ್_೧|ಸುಶ್ರವಸ್|suśravas_1|suśravas|sushravas_1|sushravas|_pe_@7301|_pe_pn774L
