">jayatsena</a> of the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुरु">puru</a> dynasty married her and a son called Arvācīna was born to them. (Ādi Parva, Chapter 95, Verse 17).</div></div></div>

सुश्रवस्_२|सुश्रवस्|సుశ్రవస్_౨|సుశ్రవస్|ಸುಶ್ರವಸ್_೨|ಸುಶ್ರವಸ್|suśravas_2|suśravas|sushravas_2|sushravas|_pe_@7302|_pe_pn774L
