_a_pada" href="होम">homa</a> and the father of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="बल">bala</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="भागवत">bhāgavata</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="स्कन्ध">skandha</a> 9).</div></div></div>

