 href="श्वेतकेतु">śvetaketu</a> (son of a sage) married her and the couple attained salvation by performing the duties of the householder. (M.B. Southern Text, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="शान्ति">śānti</a> Parva, Chapter 220).</div></div></div>

