<a class="pe_a_pada" href="हिमवान्">himavān</a>, the other one being <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अतिवर्चस्">ativarcas</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="शल्य">śalya</a> Parva, Chapter 45, Verse 46).</div></div></div>

