a class="pe_a_pada" href="भीम">bhīma</a> in the great war. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="द्रोण पर्व">droṇa parva</a>, Chapter 127, Verse 66).</div></div></div>

सुवर्ण_१|सुवर्ण|సువర్ణ_౧|సువర్ణ|ಸುವರ್ಣ_೧|ಸುವರ್ಣ|suvarṇa_1|suvarṇa|suvarNa_1|suvarNa|_pe_@7345|_pe_pn776L
