" href="राम">rāma</a> and <a class="pe_a_pada" href="लक्ष्मण">lakṣmaṇa</a>, before entering <a class="pe_a_pada" href="लंका">laṅkā</a> with the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="मोन्केय्">monkey</a>-force, had surveyed the city from the top of this <a class="pe_a_pada" href="मोउन्तैन्">mountain</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="वाल्मीकि">vālmīki</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="रामायण">rāmāyaṇa</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="युद्ध">yuddha</a> Kāṇḍa Chapters 38 and 39).</div></div></div>

