" href="क्षेम">kṣema</a> and father of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="विश्वजित्">viśvajit</a>, (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="भागवत">bhāgavata</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="स्कन्ध">skandha</a> 1).</div></div></div>

