f="पूरु">pūru</a> dynasty. She was wedded to King <a class="pe_a_pada" href="महाभौम">mahābhauma</a> and King Ayutanāyī was their son. (Ādi Parva, Chapter 95, Verse 20).</div></div></div>

सुयजु|సుయజు|ಸುಯಜು|suyaju|_pe_@7374|_pe_pn776R
