आयुस्">āyus</a>, the son of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुरूरवस्">purūravas</a> married Śvarbhānavī. Five sons beginning with <a class="pe_a_pada" href="नहुष">nahuṣa</a> were born to the couple. (M.B. Ādi Parva, Chapter 75, Verse 26).</div></div></div>

