 to Kaśyapaprajāpati by his wife <a class="pe_a_pada" href="दनु">danu</a>. It is mentioned in <a class="pe_a_pada" href="महाभारत">mahābhārata</a>, Ādi Parva, Chapter 67, Verse 12 that <a class="pe_a_pada" href="उग्रसेन">ugrasena</a> the father of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कंस">kaṁsa</a> was the rebirth of this <a class="pe_a_pada" href="दानव">dānava</a>.</div></div></div>

