व्रज">girivraja</a>. It is mentioned in <a class="pe_a_pada" href="महाभारत">mahābhārata</a>, Sabhā Parva, Chapter 9, Verse 9, that this serpent lives in the palace of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="वरुण">varuṇa</a>.</div></div></div>

