 Navakanyās. They were married by the sons of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अग्नीध्र">agnīdhra</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="भागवत">bhāgavata</a>, 5th <a class="pe_a_pada" href="स्कन्ध">skandha</a>).</div></div></div>

