ass="pe_a_pada" href="यज्ञ">yajña</a> of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="उपरिचरवसु">uparicaravasu</a>. He observed correctly the duties of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="वानप्रस्थ">vānaprastha</a> and attained svarga. (Śloka 17, Chapter 244, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="शान्ति">śānti</a> Parva).</div></div></div>

