ासुर">tārakāsura</a>. This demon was the lord of a golden city called <a class="pe_a_pada" href="त्रिपुर">tripura</a>. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="शिव">śiva</a> killed him during Tripuradahana (burning of the Tripuras). See under Tripuradahana. (Chapters 33, 34, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कर्ण">karṇa</a> Parva).</div></div></div>

