alled on the boundary of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कुरुक्षेत्र">kurukṣetra</a>. If one spends one night in this holy place one would get the benefit of giving away a thousand cows as gifts. (Chapter 83, Vana Parva).</div></div></div>

