> and father of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="त्रिशंकु">triśaṅku</a>. (Chapter 57, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="ब्रह्माण्ड">brahmāṇḍa</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुराण">purāṇa</a>).</div></div></div>

