 class="pe_a_pada" href="व्यास">vyāsa</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="शिव">śiva</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुराण">purāṇa</a>, Śatarudrasaṁhitā).</div></div></div>

