pada" href="चित्रसेन">citrasena</a>. (M.B. Ādi Parva, Chapter 67, Verse 100). This <a class="pe_a_pada" href="उग्रसेन">ugrasena</a> was killed by <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भीम">bhīma</a>. (M.B. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="द्रोण पर्व">droṇa parva</a>, Chapter 137).</div></div></div>

