 battle of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कुरुक्षेत्र">kurukṣetra</a>. (M.B. Ādi Parva, Chapter 67, Verse 100, and <a class="pe_a_pada" href="द्रोण पर्व">droṇa parva</a>, Chapter 157, Verse 19).</div></div></div>

