 href="पाण्डवस्">pāṇḍavas</a>. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कर्ण">karṇa</a> wounded him in war. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="कर्ण">karṇa</a> Parva, Chapter 56, Verse 44).</div></div></div>

