5). In the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="महाभारत">mahābhārata</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="द्रोण">droṇa</a> Parva, Chapter 136 Stanza 22 it is mentioned that he was killed by Bhīmasena.</div></div></div>

