म">bhīṣma</a> Parva, Chapter 91, Stanza 84).</div></div></div>

उपाय स्|उपाय|ఉపాయ స్|ఉపాయ|ಉಪಾಯ ಸ್|ಉಪಾಯ|upāya s|upāya|upaaya s|upaaya|_pe_@7757|_pe_pn810L
