da" href="मन्वन्तर">manvantara</a>. The seven hermits of the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="स्वारोचिष">svārociṣa</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="मन्वन्तर">manvantara</a> were <a class="pe_a_pada" href="ऊर्ज्ज">ūrjja</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="स्तम्भ">stambha</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="प्राण">prāṇa</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="वात">vāta</a>, Pṛṣabha Niraya and Parīvān. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="विष्णु">viṣṇu</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुराण">purāṇa</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अंश">aṁśa</a> 3, Chapter 1).</div></div></div>

