s="pe_a_pada" href="उषा">uṣā</a> and Ghuṣṭi is called <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सन्ध्या">sandhyā</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="विष्णु">viṣṇu</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुराण">purāṇa</a>, Aṁ a 2, Chapter 8).</div></div></div>

