ref="वृजिनीवान्">vṛjinīvān</a> and his son was called <a class="pe_a_pada" href="चित्ररथ">citraratha</a>. (M.B. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अनु">anu</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="आसन">āsana</a> Parva, Chapter 147, Stanza 29).</div></div></div>

