t is stated in <a class="pe_a_pada" href="महाभारत">mahābhārata</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अनुशासन पर्व">anuśāsana parva</a>, Chapter 30, Stanza 63 that he was the father of King Pramiti.</div></div></div>

