 href="पुरु">puru</a>, by his wife <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सौवीरी">sauvīrī</a>. This son had two brothers <a class="pe_a_pada" href="शक्त">śakta</a> and Saṁhanana. (M.B. Ādi Parva, Chapter 24, Stanza 45).</div></div></div>

