">vahni</a> had a son named <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भर्ग">bharga</a> who became very famous. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="भागवत">bhāgavata</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="स्कन्ध">skandha</a> 9; <a class="pe_a_pada" href="ब्रह्माण्ड">brahmāṇḍa</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुराण">purāṇa</a>, 3: 74. 1).</div></div></div>

