pe_a_pada" href="वैमित्रा">vaimitrā</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="काकी">kākī</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="हलिमा">halimā</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="मालिनी">mālinī</a>, Bṛhadā, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="आर्या">āryā</a> and <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पलाला">palālā</a>. (M.B. Vana Parva, Chapter 228, Stanza 10).</div></div></div>

