" href="पितृस्">pitṛs</a> are, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="वैराज">vairāja</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अग्निष्वात्त">agniṣvātta</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सोमपा">somapā</a>; Gārhapatya, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="एकशृंग">ekaśṛṅga</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="चतुर्वेद">caturveda</a> and <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कल">kala</a>. (M.B. Sabhā Parva, Chapter 11, Stanza 46).</div></div></div>

