ī</a> whom <a class="pe_a_pada" href="प्रद्युम्न">pradyumna</a> the son of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="श्री कृष्ण">śrī kṛṣṇa</a> married, was the daughter of this <a class="pe_a_pada" href="असुर">asura</a>. (For details see under <a class="pe_a_pada" href="प्रभावती">prabhāvatī</a>).</div></div></div>

