o the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="राजसूय">rājasūya</a> (imperial consecration) of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="युधिष्ठिर">yudhiṣṭhira</a>. (M.B. Sabhā Parva, Chapter 51, Stanza 17).</div></div></div>

