>vanaspati</a> according to <a class="pe_a_pada" href="मनुस्मृति">manusmṛti</a> Chapter 1, Stanza 47. Atti (fig tree) is an example. (Apuṣpāḥ phalavanto ye te vanaspatayas smṛtāḥ).</div></div></div>

