lmīki</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="रामायण">rāmāyaṇa</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अरण्य">araṇya</a> Kāṇḍa <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सर्ग">sarga</a> 69, Stanza 22).</div></div></div>

