d scientist in the palace of King <a class="pe_a_pada" href="जनक">janaka</a>. He defeated the hermit Kahoḍaka in an argument and dipped him in water. (For further details see under <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अष्टावक्र">aṣṭāvakra</a>).</div></div></div>

