ṣa</a> remains in the palace of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कुबेर">kubera</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="महाभारत">mahābhārata</a>, Sabhā Parva, Chapter 13, Stanza 16).</div></div></div>

