 href="विश्वावसु">viśvāvasu</a> learned about the connection between the individual soul and the Universal soul, from this hermit. (M.B. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="शान्ति">śānti</a> Parva, Chapter 318, Verse 59).</div></div></div>

