<a class="pe_a_pada" href="दक्ष">dakṣa</a>, took birth again from the sacrifice of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="वरुण">varuṇa</a>. At this stage the name of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भृगु">bhṛgu</a> was Vāruṇibhṛgu. (For further details see under <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भृगु">bhṛgu</a> I).</div></div></div>

