class="pe_a_pada" href="महाभारत">mahābhārata</a>, Sabhā Parva,  Chapter 52, Stanza 15, that the princes of this country gave presents to <a class="pe_a_pada" href="युधिष्ठिर">yudhiṣṭhira</a> at the time of his sacrifice of royal consecration.</div></div></div>

