t is mentioned in <a class="pe_a_pada" href="महाभारत">mahābhārata</a>, Vana Parva, Chapter 84, that he who bathes in this <a class="pe_a_pada" href="तीर्थ">tīrtha</a> would become a Brahmin.</div></div></div>

