ned in Ādi Parva, Chapter 214, Stanza 2, that <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अर्जुन">arjuna</a> came and sat on this <a class="pe_a_pada" href="मोउन्तैन्">mountain</a> during his pilgrimage.</div></div></div>

