" href="थ्रेए">three</a> worlds. Those who bathe in this place will enjoy the fruits of performing <a class="pe_a_pada" href="वाजपेय">vājapeya</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="यज्ञ">yajña</a>. (Drinking sacrifice). (M.B. Vana Parva, Chapter 87, Stanza 140).</div></div></div>

