ss="pe_a_pada" href="पाण्डवस्">pāṇḍavas</a>. He was killed by Droṇācārya. (M.B. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="द्रोण पर्व">droṇa parva</a>, Chapter 21, Stanza 55).</div></div></div>

वसुदानपुत्र|వసుదానపుత్ర|ವಸುದಾನಪುತ್ರ|vasudānaputra|vasudaanaputra|_pe_@8104|_pe_pn837R
