ght against the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पाण्डवस्">pāṇḍavas</a>. He killed Abhibhū, the son of King of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="काशी">kāśī</a>. (M.B. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कर्ण">karṇa</a> Parva, Chapter 4, Stanza 74).</div></div></div>

