 href="जनक">janaka</a>. It is mentioned in <a class="pe_a_pada" href="महाभारत">mahābhārata</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="शान्ति">śānti</a> Parva, Chapter 309, that a hermit had given him exhortations regarding righteousness.</div></div></div>

