a_pada" href="महाभारत">mahābhārata</a>, Ādi Parva, Chapter 67, Stanza 41 that this King was born from a portion of the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="असुर">asura</a> named <a class="pe_a_pada" href="विक्षर">vikṣara</a>, the son of Danāyu.</div></div></div>

