 class="pe_a_pada" href="भागवत">bhāgavata</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="स्कन्ध">skandha</a> 10, that <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भद्रक">bhadraka</a>, otherwise called Udaṅka was the son of this King.</div></div></div>

