ame <a class="pe_a_pada" href="वसुषेण">vasuṣeṇa</a> by his foster-father <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अधिरथ">adhiratha</a> and his foster-mother <a class="pe_a_pada" href="राधा">rādhā</a>. (See under <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कर्ण">karṇa</a>).</div></div></div>

