्दिअ">india</a>. It is mentioned in <a class="pe_a_pada" href="महाभारत">mahābhārata</a>, Ādi Parva, Chapter 67, Stanza 63 that this King was born from a portion of the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="असुर">asura</a> named <a class="pe_a_pada" href="क्रोधवश">krodhavaśa</a>.</div></div></div>

