e <a class="pe_a_pada" href="स्वयंवर">svayaṁvara</a> (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="मर्रिअगे">marriage</a>) of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="द्रौपदी">draupadī</a> (M.B. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अरण्य">araṇya</a>: Chapter 177, Verse 2).</div></div></div>

