yal hermits such as <a class="pe_a_pada" href="वय्य">vayya</a>, Karkandhu and others in <a class="pe_a_pada" href="ऋग्वेद">ṛgveda</a>, Maṇḍala 1, Sūkta 112.</div></div></div>

