rigin of river Indus. He who visits this holy place will attain the fruits of horse sacrifice and will enter heaven. (M.B. Vana Parva, Chapter 84, Stanza 47).</div></div></div>

वेदीतीर्थ_२|वेदीतीर्थ|వేదీతీర్థ_౨|వేదీతీర్థ|ವೇದೀತೀರ್ಥ_೨|ವೇದೀತೀರ್ಥ|vedītīrtha_2|vedītīrtha|vediitiirtha_2|vediitiirtha|vedeeteertha_2|vedeeteertha|_pe_@8187|_pe_pn844L
