>kaurava</a> family. This serpent also fell in the sacrificial fire of the serpent sacrifice of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="जनमेजय">janamejaya</a> and was burnt to <a class="pe_a_pada" href="देअथ्">death</a>. (M.B. Ādi Parva, Chapter 57, Stanza 12).</div></div></div>

