हाभारत">mahābhārata</a>, Vana Parva, Chapter 254, Stanza 15, that this <a class="pe_a_pada" href="यादव">yādava</a> was defeated by <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कर्ण">karṇa</a> during his regional conquest.</div></div></div>

