<a class="pe_a_pada" href="शतजित्">śatajit</a> and the brother of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="महाहय">mahāhaya</a> and <a class="pe_a_pada" href="हेहय">hehaya</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="भागवत">bhāgavata</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="स्कन्ध">skandha</a> 9).</div></div></div>

