="pe_a_pada" href="महाभारत">mahābhārata</a>, Vana Parva, Chapter 84, Stanza 56, that those who visit this place will obtain the fruits of Horse sacrifice and will attain the world of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="शुक्राचार्य">śukrācārya</a>.</div></div></div>

