ada" href="भागवत">bhāgavata</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="स्कन्ध">skandha</a> 5, that he was the son of Prastotā and the father of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पृथुषेण">pṛthuṣeṇa</a>.</div></div></div>

