अंगिरस्">aṅgiras</a>. The <a class="pe_a_pada" href="थ्रेए">three</a> sons of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सुधन्वा">sudhanvā</a> were <a class="pe_a_pada" href="ऋभु">ṛbhu</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="विभ्वा">vibhvā</a> and <a class="pe_a_pada" href="वाज">vāja</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="ऋग्वेद">ṛgveda</a>, Manḍala 1, Sūkta 111).</div></div></div>

