 He was of opinion that liquor, alcoholic medicine, honey, flesh, etc. should be avoided. It is not ordained in the Vedas that these things should be used. (M.B. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="शान्ति">śānti</a> Parva, Chapter 265, Stanzas 3-12).</div></div></div>

