="महाभारत">mahābhārata</a>, Ādi Parva, Chapter 67, Stanza 61, that this King was born from a portion of the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="असुर">asura</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="क्रोधवश">krodhavaśa</a>.</div></div></div>

