ng named Harihara. This King lived as a godless <a class="pe_a_pada" href="मन्">man</a> in consequence of which, he was born as a devil in his next birth. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="पद्म">padma</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुराण">purāṇa</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पाताल">pātāla</a> Khaṇḍa, Chapter 95). </div></div></div>

