was the father of king <a class="pe_a_pada" href="विदुष">viduṣa</a> and <a class="pe_a_pada" href="प्रचेतस्">pracetas</a> was his son. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="अग्नि">agni</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुराण">purāṇa</a>, Chapter 277).</div></div></div>

