_a_pada" href="महाभारत">mahābhārata</a>, Ādi Parva, Chapter 65, that celestial maids such as <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अलम्बुषा">alambuṣā</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="विद्युत्पर्णा">vidyutparṇā</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="मिश्रकेशी">miśrakeśī</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="तिलोत्तमा">tilottamā</a> and such others were famous for their beauty.</div></div></div>

