a>). This <a class="pe_a_pada" href="असुर">asura</a> pleased Rudradeva by penance and acquired from him the control of all the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="थ्रेए">three</a> worlds for one lakh of years, the recognition as a follower of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="शिव">śiva</a> and the kingdom of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कुशद्वीप">kuśadvīpa</a>, as boons. (M.B. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अनुशासन पर्व">anuśāsana parva</a>, Chapter 14).</div></div></div>

