mīki</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="रामायण">rāmāyaṇa</a>, Bālakāṇḍa, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सर्ग">sarga</a> 7, Stanza 3).</div></div></div>

विजय_२|विजय|విజయ_౨|విజయ|ವಿಜಯ_೨|ವಿಜಯ|vijaya_2|vijaya|_pe_@8306|_pe_pn853L
