्माण्ड">brahmāṇḍa</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुराण">purāṇa</a>, Chapter 73, that this King <a class="pe_a_pada" href="विजय">vijaya</a> of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कोसल">kosala</a> confronted <a class="pe_a_pada" href="परशुराम">paraśurāma</a> and was defeated.</div></div></div>

