lass="pe_a_pada" href="जय">jaya</a> and <a class="pe_a_pada" href="दुर्जय">durjaya</a>, two <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कौरवस्">kauravas</a> and fought with <a class="pe_a_pada" href="नील">nīla</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="काश्य">kāśya</a> and <a class="pe_a_pada" href="जयत्सेन">jayatsena</a>. (M.B. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="द्रोण">droṇa</a> Parva, Chapter 25, Stanza 45).</div></div></div>

