f="शिव">śiva</a> in <a class="pe_a_pada" href="महाभारत">mahābhārata</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अनुशासन पर्व">anuśāsana parva</a>, Chapter 17, Stanza 51.</div></div></div>

