" href="सुरभि">surabhi</a>. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="रोहिणी">rohiṇī</a> had two daughters called <a class="pe_a_pada" href="विमला">vimalā</a> and <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अनला">analā</a>. (M.B. Ādi Parva, Chapter 66, Stanza 67).</div></div></div>

विमलपिण्डक|విమలపిణ్డక|ವಿಮಲಪಿಣ್ಡಕ|vimalapiṇḍaka|vimalapiNDaka|_pe_@8356|_pe_pn856L
