ति">prajāpati</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कश्यप">kaśyapa</a> by his wife <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कद्रू">kadrū</a>. (M.B. Ādi Parva, Chapter 35, Stanza 8).</div></div></div>

विमलाशोकतीर्थ|విమలాశోకతీర్థ|ವಿಮಲಾಶೋಕತೀರ್ಥ|vimalāśokatīrtha|vimalaashokatiirtha|vimalaashokateertha|_pe_@8357|_pe_pn856L
