> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कश्यप">kaśyapa</a> by his wife <a class="pe_a_pada" href="काला">kālā</a> (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="कालिका">kālikā</a>). (M.B. Ādi Parva, Chapter 65, Stanza 34).</div></div></div>

