ref="महाभारत">mahābhārata</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अनुशासन पर्व">anuśāsana parva</a>, Chapter 150, Stanza 25).</div></div></div>

विनायक_२|विनायक|వినాయక_౨|వినాయక|ವಿನಾಯಕ_೨|ವಿನಾಯಕ|vināyaka_2|vināyaka|vinaayaka_2|vinaayaka|_pe_@8372|_pe_pn856R
