a class="pe_a_pada" href="कश्यप">kaśyapa</a> by his wife <a class="pe_a_pada" href="दनु">danu</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="महाभारत">mahābhārata</a>, Ādi Parva, Chapter 65, Stanza 33).</div></div></div>

