prajāpati</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कश्यप">kaśyapa</a> by his wife <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कद्रू">kadrū</a>. (M.B. Ādi Parva, Chapter 35, Stanza 13).</div></div></div>

विरजस्_२|विरज_२|विरजस्|विरज|విరజస్_౨|విరజ_౨|విరజస్|విరజ|ವಿರಜಸ್_೨|ವಿರಜ_೨|ವಿರಜಸ್|ವಿರಜ|virajas_2|viraja_2|virajas|viraja|_pe_@8414|_pe_pn860L
