ुराण">purāṇa</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="वीरणी">vīraṇī</a> was a disciple of the famous teacher <a class="pe_a_pada" href="याज्ञवल्क्य">yājñavalkya</a> of the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="यजुर्वेद">yajurveda</a>-line of disciples of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="व्यास">vyāsa</a>.</div></div></div>

विरस|విరస|ವಿರಸ|virasa|_pe_@8430|_pe_pn860R
