="महाभारत">mahābhārata</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अनुशासन पर्व">anuśāsana parva</a>, Chapter 115, Stanza 65, that this King did not eat meat. (For further details see under <a class="pe_a_pada" href="दमयन्ती">damayantī</a>).</div></div></div>

