f="वीरव्रत">vīravrata</a> who was the son of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="मधु">madhu</a>, two sons named Manthu and <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अमन्थु">amanthu</a> were born. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="भागवत">bhāgavata</a>, Fifth <a class="pe_a_pada" href="स्कन्ध">skandha</a>).</div></div></div>

