f="घटोत्कच">ghaṭotkaca</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="महाभारत">mahābhārata</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="द्रोण पर्व">droṇa parva</a>, Chapter 175, Stanza 15).</div></div></div>

