 called <a class="pe_a_pada" href="राजधर्मा">rājadharmā</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="महाभारत">mahābhārata</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="शान्ति">śānti</a> Parva, Chapter 170, Stanza 15). (See under <a class="pe_a_pada" href="गौतम">gautama</a> V).</div></div></div>

