a class="pe_a_pada" href="राजसूय">rājasūya</a> (Imperial consecration) of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="युधिष्ठिर">yudhiṣṭhira</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="भागवत">bhāgavata</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="स्कन्ध">skandha</a> 10).</div></div></div>

