(M.B. Vana Parva, Chapter 289, Stanza 6)</div></div></div>

विशल्यकरणी|విశల్యకరణీ|ವಿಶಲ್ಯಕರಣೀ|viśalyakaraṇī|vishalyakaraNii|vishalyakaraNee|_pe_@8489|_pe_pn863R
