_pada" href="पुराण">purāṇa</a>, that <a class="pe_a_pada" href="विशिख">viśikha</a> was one of the sons born to <a class="pe_a_pada" href="गरुड">garuḍa</a> by <a class="pe_a_pada" href="शुकी">śukī</a>.</div></div></div>

