</a> by <a class="pe_a_pada" href="त्रिवक्रा">trivakrā</a>. This prince who was the disciple of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="नारद">nārada</a> had written the book, “Sātvatatantra”. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="भागवत">bhāgavata</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="स्कन्ध">skandha</a> 10).</div></div></div>

