, Chapter 38, that <a class="pe_a_pada" href="श्री कृष्ण">śrī kṛṣṇa</a> had a wife called <a class="pe_a_pada" href="विशोका">viśokā</a>.</div></div></div>

विशोका_२|विशोका|విశోకా_౨|విశోకా|ವಿಶೋಕಾ_೨|ವಿಶೋಕಾ|viśokā_2|viśokā|vishokaa_2|vishokaa|_pe_@8517|_pe_pn868R
