त">mahābhārata</a>, Ādi Parva, Chapter 67, Stanza 36, that this King was born from a portion of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="मयूर">mayūra</a>, an <a class="pe_a_pada" href="असुर">asura</a>.</div></div></div>

