a class="pe_a_pada" href="महाभारत">mahābhārata</a>, Sabhā Parva, Chapter 27, Stanza 14, that this King was defeated by <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अर्जुन">arjuna</a> during his Northern Regional conquest.</div></div></div>

विश्वजित्_१|विश्वजित्|విశ్వజిత్_౧|విశ్వజిత్|ವಿಶ್ವಜಿತ್_೧|ವಿಶ್ವಜಿತ್|viśvajit_1|viśvajit|vishvajit_1|vishvajit|_pe_@8533|_pe_pn869R
