 father of King <a class="pe_a_pada" href="शुण्डु">śuṇḍu</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="अग्नि">agni</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुराण">purāṇa</a>, Chapter 278).</div></div></div>

