ahābhārata</a>, Sabhā Parva, Chapter 14, that <a class="pe_a_pada" href="वितद्रु">vitadru</a> was one of the seven Kings of the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="यदु">yadu</a> dynasty.</div></div></div>

