ef="केशिनी">keśinī</a>. It is stated in <a class="pe_a_pada" href="महाभारत">mahābhārata</a>, Ādi Parva, Chapter 94, Stanza 31, that he was the brother of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="जह्नु">jahnu</a> and <a class="pe_a_pada" href="रूपिण">rūpiṇa</a>.</div></div></div>

