 class="pe_a_pada" href="पाण्डवस्">pāṇḍavas</a>. It is mentioned in <a class="pe_a_pada" href="महाभारत">mahābhārata</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="द्रोण पर्व">droṇa parva</a>, Chapter 200, Stanza 73, that in the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भारत">bhārata</a> battle, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अश्वत्थामा">aśvatthāmā</a> killed him.</div></div></div>

