side of the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पाण्डवस्">pāṇḍavas</a> in the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भारत">bhārata</a> battle and was killed by <a class="pe_a_pada" href="बाल्हीक">bālhīka</a>. (M.B. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="द्रोण पर्व">droṇa parva</a>, Chapter 24, Stanza. 49).</div></div></div>

