"pe_a_pada" href="मनु">manu</a>. He was the father of hermit <a class="pe_a_pada" href="उषंगु">uṣaṅgu</a> (M.B. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अनुशासन पर्व">anuśāsana parva</a>, Chapter 147, Stanza 23).</div></div></div>

