y the teacher <a class="pe_a_pada" href="द्रोण">droṇa</a> in the battle of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भारत">bhārata</a>. (M.B. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="द्रोण पर्व">droṇa parva</a>, Chapter 21, Stanza 16).</div></div></div>

