ed in <a class="pe_a_pada" href="महाभारत">mahābhārata</a>. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="द्रोण पर्व">droṇa parva</a>, Chapter 127, Stanza 33, that he was killed by Bhīmasena in the battle of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भारत">bhārata</a>.</div></div></div>

