 the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पाण्डवस्">pāṇḍavas</a>. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="अभिमन्यु">abhimanyu</a> killed this warrior. (M.B. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="द्रोण पर्व">droṇa parva</a>, Chapter 47, Stanza 12).</div></div></div>

