 class="pe_a_pada" href="ब्रह्माण्ड">brahmāṇḍa</a> <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पुराण">purāṇa</a>, that this prince escaped from the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="क्षत्रिय">kṣatriya</a> extermination of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="परशुराम">paraśurāma</a>.</div></div></div>

