href="काशी">kāśī</a>. (See under <a class="pe_a_pada" href="उशीनर">uśīnara</a>).</div></div></div>

वृषादर्भि_१|वृषादर्भि|వృషాదర్భి_౧|వృషాదర్భి|ವೃಷಾದರ್ಭಿ_೧|ವೃಷಾದರ್ಭಿ|vṛṣādarbhi_1|vṛṣādarbhi|vRShaadarbhi_1|vRShaadarbhi|vRiShaadarbhi_1|vRiShaadarbhi|vRuShaadarbhi_1|vRuShaadarbhi|vRRiShaadarbhi_1|vRRiShaadarbhi|_pe_@8638|_pe_pn882L
