three</a> brothers named <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भद्र">bhadra</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="सुवीर">suvīra</a> and <a class="pe_a_pada" href="केकय">kekaya</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="भागवत">bhāgavata</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="स्कन्ध">skandha</a> 9).</div></div></div>

