a class="pe_a_pada" href="महाभारत">mahābhārata</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="द्रोण पर्व">droṇa parva</a>, Chapter 80, Stanza 33, that this warrior stood in the heart of the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="गरुड">garuḍa</a>-disposition of the army formed by <a class="pe_a_pada" href="द्रोण">droṇa</a>.</div></div></div>

