ada" href="दुष्यन्त">duṣyanta</a>. He was the son of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="चतुरंग">caturaṅga</a> and the grandson of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="रोमपाद">romapāda</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="भागवत">bhāgavata</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="स्कन्ध">skandha</a> 9).</div></div></div>

