ada" href="ऋग्वेद">ṛgveda</a>, Maṇḍala 1, Anuvāka 10, Sūkta 51,  that once <a class="pe_a_pada" href="इन्द्र">indra</a> took birth as the daughter of this King under the name <a class="pe_a_pada" href="मेना">menā</a>.</div></div></div>

