href="दुष्यन्त">duṣyanta</a>. It is mentioned in <a class="pe_a_pada" href="भागवत">bhāgavata</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="स्कन्ध">skandha</a> 9, that <a class="pe_a_pada" href="व्योम">vyoma</a> was the son of Dāśārha and the father of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="जीमूत">jīmūta</a>.</div></div></div>

