f="कृष्ण">kṛṣṇa</a> killed this <a class="pe_a_pada" href="असुर">asura</a>, see under <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कृष्ण">kṛṣṇa</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पर">para</a> 24.</div></div></div>

