 href="भागवत">bhāgavata</a>, 5th <a class="pe_a_pada" href="स्कन्ध">skandha</a>, there is a statement saying that it was at this place that the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="दानव">dānava</a> called <a class="pe_a_pada" href="रम्भ">rambha</a> took a she-buffalo as his wife.</div></div></div>

यक्षयुद्धपर्व|యక్షయుద్ధపర్వ|ಯಕ್ಷಯುದ್ಧಪರ್ವ|yakṣayuddhaparva|yakShayuddhaparva|yaxayuddhaparva|_pe_@8711|_pe_pn893L
