_a_pada" href="पाण्डवस्">pāṇḍavas</a> against the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="कौरवस्">kauravas</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="महाभारत">mahābhārata</a>, <a class="pe_a_pada" href="द्रोण पर्व">droṇa parva</a>, Chapter 184, Verse 5).</div></div></div>

