_pada" href="हस्ति">hasti</a>, King of the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="पूरु">pūru</a> dynasty and they a had a son named Vikaṇṭha. (M.B. Ādi Parva, Chapter 95, Verse 35).</div></div></div>

