वत">bhāgavata</a>, 8th <a class="pe_a_pada" href="स्कन्ध">skandha</a> mentions that god <a class="pe_a_pada" href="ईशान">īśāna</a>, the ruler of the north-eastern part, lives in the city called <a class="pe_a_pada" href="यशोवती">yaśovatī</a>.</div></div></div>

