 class="pe_a_pada" href="ययाति">yayāti</a>. <a class="pe_a_pada" href="महाभारत">mahābhārata</a>, Ādi Parva,  Chapter 75, Verse 31, mentions that he became a yogī and lived in the forest.</div></div></div>

