ारत">mahābhārata</a>, Sabhā Parva, Chapter 52, Verse 14, mentions, that the Yaudheyas had participated in Yudhiṣṭhira's <a class="pe_a_pada" href="राजसूय">rājasūya</a>.</div></div></div>

