/a> Parva, Chapter 234, Verse 15, refers to another <a class="pe_a_pada" href="युवनाश्व">yuvanāśva</a> who was the son of <a class="pe_a_pada" href="वृषदर्भ">vṛṣadarbha</a>. He attained Heaven by offering gifts of jewels, women and dwelling houses.</div></div></div>

