 <a class="pe_a_pada" href="मान्धाता">māndhātā</a>. There is reference to him in the <a class="pe_a_pada" href="ऋग्वेद">ṛgveda</a>. (<a class="pe_a_pada" href="ऋग्वेद">ṛgveda</a>, 10; 134).</div></div></div>

